<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Revised Susu Gospels</book>
  <para style="h">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Inyila Isa Annabi Matiyu naxan sɛbɛxi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="mt">Inyila Isa</para>
  <para style="mt">Annabi Matiyu naxan sɛbɛxi</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitaabui naxan xili «Inyila Isa,» a dɔxɔ naani na a ra. Namiɲɔnmɛ naani nan taruxuie sɛbɛ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra naxee lanxi Inyila Isa nan ma. E xili nɛ Matiyu, Maraki, Luki, nun Yaya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isa keli xanbi duniɲa, Annabi Matiyu naxa yi Kitaabui sɛbɛ, a xa Isa xa duniɲɛigiri birin masen alako mixie xa a kolon, a Isa findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan na. A a sɛbɛ Girɛki xui nɛ, kɔnɔ muxu bara a madangi Soso xui alako Sosoe fan xa nɔ a fahaamude.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isa xa kaabanako gbegbe sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui alako mixie xa a sɛnbɛ kolon, Ala sɛnbɛ naxan fixi a ma. A furemae rayalan nɛ, a ɲinnɛ ragbilen mixie fɔxɔ ra. Annabi Matiyu bara wa mixie xa Isa xa kawandie fan kolon. Isa to mixie xaran Ala xa masenyi ra, e naxa a kolon, a a nɔndi yati yati nan masenma. A dɔnxɔɛ ra, yi Kitaabui Isa faxa ki nan dɛntɛgɛ sama nun a keli ki faxɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na birin nɔma fahaamui fide won ma, won xa a kolon nde na Isa ra. Won lɔnni naxan sɔtɔma yi Kitaabui kui, a nɔma won malide won ma duniɲɛigiri kui, a man nɔma won malide aligiyama. Ala xa a lu won xaxili ma. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Inyila Isa</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Matiyu naxan sɛbɛxi</para>
  <para style="cl">Sora</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Isa benbae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luki 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Isa, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi naxan fatan Dawuda nun Iburahima bɔnsɔɛ ra, a benbae xilie nan yi ki:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Iburahima naxa Isiyaga sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:2">Isiyaga naxa Yaxuba sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:2">Yaxuba naxa Yuda nun a taarae nun a xunyae sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda naxa Peresi nun Sera sɔtɔ, Tamari xa die.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:3">Peresi naxa Xesiron sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:3">Xesiron naxa Arami sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Arami naxa Aminadabo sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadabo naxa Naxason sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:4">Naxason naxa Salimon sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimon naxa Boosu sɔtɔ, Raxabi xa di.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:5">Boosu naxa Obedo sɔtɔ, Ruti xa di.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Obedo naxa Yisayi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:6">Yisayi naxa Dawuda sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:6">Mangɛ Dawuda naxa Sulemani sɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:6">Uriya xa ginɛ saabui ra.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sulemani naxa Robowami sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:7">Robowami naxa Abiya sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:7">Abiya naxa Asa sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa naxa Yehosafati sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehosafati naxa Yehorami sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehorami naxa Yusiya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Yusiya naxa Yotami sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotami naxa Axasi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:9">Axasi naxa Xesekiya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Xesekiya naxa Manasi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:10">Manasi naxa Amon sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon naxa Yosiya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosiya naxa Yekoniya nun a xunyae sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:11">Isirayilakae xaninxi Babilɔn tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />E to siga Babilɔn, Yekoniya naxa Salatiyeli sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:12">Salatiyeli naxa Sorobabeli sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Sorobabeli naxa Abiyudi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:13">Abiyudi naxa Eliyakimi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliyakimi naxa Asoro sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asoro naxa Sadɔki sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadɔki naxa Aximi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:14">Aximi naxa Eliyudi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyudi naxa Eleyasari sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleyasari naxa Matan sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:15">Matan naxa Yaxuba sɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yaxuba naxa Yusufu sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:16">Yusufu naxa Mariyama dɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:16">Mariyama nan findi Isa nga ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:16">naxan xili Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />A birin nalanxi benba dɔxɔ fu nun naani, keli Iburahima ma sa dɔxɔ Dawuda ra. A birin nalanxi benba dɔxɔ fu nun naani, keli Dawuda ma, han Isirayilakae siga tɛmui naxɛ Babilɔn. A birin nalanxi benba dɔxɔ fu nun naani, keli Isirayilakae siga tɛmui ma Babilɔn, han a sa dɔxɔ Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa waxati ra.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa bari ki naxɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 1:26-38">Luki 1:26-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa xa bari raba yi ki nɛ: Yusufu nu bara Isa nga Mariyama xa kote dɔxɔ, kɔnɔ beenun e xa kafu, Mariyama naxa tɛɛgɛ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa kaabanako saabui ra. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />A xa mɔri Yusufu to findixi tinxintɔɛ ra, a mu nu waxi Mariyama xili kanafe. A naxa natɛ tongo e xa fatan gundoɲɔxɔɲa kui. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />A nu a maɲɔxunma na fe ma tɛmui naxɛ, Marigi xa malekɛ nde naxa mini a ma xiye kui, a a masen a bɛ, «Yusufu, i tan naxan kelixi Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ, i naxa gaaxu i xa ginɛ Mariyama futife ra, barima a tɛɛgɛxi di naxan ma, a fatanxi Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa kaabanako nan na. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Mariyama fama di xɛmɛ nan baride. I xa a xili sa Isa, barima a tan nan fama a xa ɲama rakiside e xa yunubie ma.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Na birin naba nɛ alako Marigi naxan masen namiɲɔnmɛ saabui ra, a xa kamali alɔ a sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui ki naxɛ,<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Ginɛdimɛdi tɛɛgɛma nɛ, a di xɛmɛ bari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">E a xili falama nɛ Emanuwɛli.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Na nan na ki, «Ala na won ya ma.»<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Yusufu to xunu, a naxa Marigi xa malekɛ xa yaamari rabatu, a a xa ginɛ xa futi xiri. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Kɔnɔ a mu a kolon ginɛ ra han Mariyama xa di xɛmɛ bari xanbi. A naxa na di xili sa Isa.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Karamɔxɔe Isa binyafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Isa bari Bɛtɛlɛɛmu taa nan kui, Yudaya bɔxi ma, mangɛ Herode xa ɲamanɛ. Na waxati, karamɔxɔ ndee naxa fa Darisalamu keli sogetede biri ra, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />e naxa maxɔrinyi ti, e naxɛ, «Yuwifie xa mangɛ naxan baxi baride, a na minden? Muxu faxi nɛ muxu xa fa suyidi a bɛ, barima muxu bara a xa tunbui to sogetede biri.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mangɛ Herode to na fe mɛ, a tan nun Darisalamuka birin naxa kɔntɔfili. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />A naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe malan, a xa e maxɔrin Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi barima dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />E naxa a yaabi, «A barima Bɛtɛlɛɛmu taa nan kui, Yudaya bɔxi ma, barima namiɲɔnmɛ a sɛbɛxi,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‹I tan Bɛtɛlɛɛmu, naxan na Yudaya bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">i tide mu xurun Yudaya taa xungbee ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">barima mangɛ fama kelide i tan Bɛtɛlɛɛmu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">naxan n ma Isirayila ɲama raɲɛrɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyi xurusee raɲɛrɛma ki naxɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Na kui, Herode naxa na karamɔxɔe xili gundo ra, a e maxɔrin tunbui minixi waxati naxan ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Na dangi xanbi, a naxa e xɛɛ Bɛtɛlɛɛmu yi xɛɛraya ra, «Wo siga, wo xa sa wakili yi diyɔrɛ fenfe ra. Wo na a to, wo xa fa n nakolon alako n fan xa sa suyidi a bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Karamɔxɔe to gɛ mangɛ xui ramɛde, e naxa siga. E man naxa tunbui to, e sa naxan to sogetede biri ra. Tunbui naxa ɲɛrɛ e ya ra han a naxa ti diyɔrɛ yire xun ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />E to tunbui to, e naxa sɛɛwa ki fanyi ra. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />E naxa so banxi kui, e naxa diyɔrɛ to a nga Mariyama yi ra. E naxa e magoro bɔxi, e suyidi diyɔrɛ bɛ. Na tɛmui, e naxa sanbasee ramini e xa kote kui, e xɛɛma, surayi fanyi, nun miri labundɛ fi diyɔrɛ ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Na dangi xanbi, Ala to nu bara e rakolon xiye kui a a mu lanma e xa gbilen Herode yire, e naxa gbilen e xa bɔxi ma kira gbɛtɛ ra.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xaninfe Misira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Karamɔxɔe siga xanbi, Marigi xa malekɛ naxa mini Yusufu ma xiye kui, a a masen a bɛ, «Keli. Diyɔrɛ nun a nga xanin Misira bɔxi ma. Wo xa lu mɛnni han n wɔyɛnma i bɛ tɛmui naxɛ, barima Herode diyɔrɛ fenma nɛ alako a xa a faxa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yusufu naxa keli kɔɛ ra, a diyɔrɛ nun a nga xanin Misira. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />E naxa lu mɛnni han Herode naxa faxa, alako Marigi naxan masen namiɲɔnmɛ saabui ra, a xa kamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:15">«N bara n ma di xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:15">a xa keli Misira.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herode diyɔrɛe faxafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Herode to a kolon a karamɔxɔe bara a madaxu, a bɔɲɛ naxa te a ɲaaxi ra. A naxa yaamari fi, di xɛmɛ birin xa faxa Bɛtɛlɛɛmu nun a rabilinyi birin, naxee mu nu ɲɛ saxan sɔtɔ sinden. A na natɛ tongo na karamɔxɔe xa tunbui to tɛmui nan ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Na kui, Annabi Yeremi xa masenyi naxa kamali,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Xui nde bara mɛ Rama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">wa xui nun sunnunyi gbegbe na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Raxele wama a xa die nan ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">a mu tinxi mixi yo xa a madundu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">barima die mu a bɛ sɔnɔn duniɲɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nun a barimixie gbilenfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Herode to faxa, Marigi xa malekɛ naxa mini Yusufu ma xiye kui Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />A naxa a masen a bɛ, «Keli, diyɔrɛ nun a nga tongo, i xa gbilen e ra Isirayila bɔxi ma, barima naxee nu waxi diyɔrɛ faxafe, e bara faxa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yusufu naxa keli, a naxa diyɔrɛ nun a nga tongo, e gbilen Isirayila bɔxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Kɔnɔ Yusufu to a mɛ a Araxelusi nan findixi Yudaya mangɛ ra a baba Herode ɲɔxɔɛ ra, a naxa gaaxu sode naa. Ala to wɔyɛn a ra xiye kui, a naxa siga Galile bɔxi ma, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />a sa sabati Nasarɛti. Na raba nɛ alako namiɲɔnmɛe xa masenyi xa kamali, naxan a masenxi, «A xili falama nɛ, ‹Nasarɛtika.›»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Yaya kawandi tife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:2-11">Maraki 1:2-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:1-22">Luki 3:1-22</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:19-34">Yaya 1:19-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Na waxati Annabi Yaya Xunxa naxa kawandi ti fɔlɔ Yudaya gbengberen yire. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />A nu a masen, «Wo tuubi, barima Ala xa mangɛya niini bara makɔrɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Annabi Esayi nu Annabi Yaya nan ma fe falafe, a to a masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">«Mixi nde a xui itema gbengberen yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‹Wo kira yailan Marigi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">wo kirae matinxin a ya ra.›»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Ɲɔxɔmɛ xabe donma nan nu ragoroxi Yaya ma, bɛlɛti kiri daaxi nu xirixi a tagi. A nu baloma katoe nun wula kumi nan na. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Darisalamukae, Yudayakae, nun mixi naxee birin nu sabatixi Yurudɛn xure rabilinyi, e nu sigama a yire. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />E nu e xa yunubie masenma kɛnɛ ma, Yaya fan nu e xunxama Yurudɛn xure xɔɔra Ala xa fe ra.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Kɔnɔ Annabi Yaya to Farisɛnie nun Saduseni gbegbe to fa ra e xa e xunxa ye xɔɔra, a naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo tan bɔximase bɔnsɔɛ! Nde wo rakolonxi wo xa wo gi Ala xa xɔnɛ ma naxan na fafe? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Wo xa fe fanyi nan naba naxan a masenma a wo bara tuubi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Wo naxa a fala wo yɛtɛ ma, ‹Iburahima nan na muxu benba ra,› barima Ala nɔma yi gɛmɛe mafindide Iburahima xa die ra. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Beera ɲan na wurie sanke ma a xa e bilie sɛgɛ. Wuri naxan yo mu bogi fanyi raminima, a sɛgɛma nɛ, a woli tɛ i. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />N tan wo xunxama ye nan xɔɔra wo xa tuubi xa fe ra, kɔnɔ naxan fama fade n xanbi ra, na sɛnbɛ gbo n tan bɛ. Na binyɛ mu na n tan yi ra hali a xa sankiri maxaninfe ra. A tan nan Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ragoroma wo ma, a tan nan wo xunxama tɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />A xa segerenyi suxuxi a yi ra, a maale nun a lagi yegetima naxan na lɔnyi ma. A maale rasoma a xa bili kui, kɔnɔ a lagi tan ganma tɛ ra naxan mu xubenma.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xunxafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maraki 1:9-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luki 3:21-22</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:32-34">Yaya 1:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Na tɛmui Isa naxa keli Galile, fafe ra Yaya yire Yurudɛn xure, alako Yaya xa a xunxa ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Kɔnɔ Yaya mu nu tinxi na fe ra. A naxa a fala, «N tan nan hayi a ma i tan xa n xunxa ye xɔɔra, kɔnɔ i tan nan fa faxi n tan xa i xunxa ye xɔɔra?» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Yakɔsi, a xa raba yi ki, barima a lanma won xa fe birin naba a sɛriyɛ ki ma.» Na kui, Yaya naxa tin a ra. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Isa xun to xa, a naxa te ye xɔɔra, koore naxa rabi, a naxa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi to goro ra a ma alɔ ganbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Xui nde naxa mɛ keli koore ma, a a masen, «N ma Di maxanuxi nan yi ki naxan n kɛnɛnxi ki fanyi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Sentanɛ katafe a xa Isa ratantan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maraki 1:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luki 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ala Xaxili naxa Isa xun ti gbengberenyi ma alako Ibulisa xa sa kata a xa a ratantan. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Isa to nu bara sun xi tongo naani, kɔɛ nun yanyi, kaamɛ nu na a ma. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Maratantanma to maso a ra, a naxa a fala a bɛ, «Xa Ala xa Di nan i ra, yaamari fi yi gɛmɛe xa findi taami ra.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «A sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, ‹Mixi mu baloma taami gbansan xa ra. Ala xa masenyi birin findixi baloe nan na adama bɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Ibulisa naxa a xanin Darisalamu, taa sɛniyɛnxi, a a ti Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi fari, yire itexi. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, «Xa Ala xa Di nan lanxi i ma, tugan, barima a sɛbɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‹Ala yaamari fima nɛ a xa malekɛe ma i xa fe ra,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‹e e bɛlɛxɛe rasoma nɛ i bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">e i ralaxun alako i sanyi naxa din gɛmɛ ra.›»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, kɔnɔ a man sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, ‹I naxa i Marigi Ala mato.›»<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Ibulisa man naxa a xanin geya itexi fari, a fa duniɲa mangɛya birin masen a bɛ, e nun e xa dariyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, «N yi birin fima nɛ i ma xa i suyidi n bɛ, i n batu.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Sentanɛ, keli be! A sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, ‹I xa i Marigi Ala gbansan nan batu, i xa suyidi a keren nan bɛ.›» <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Na wɔyɛnyi dangi xanbi, Ibulisa naxa keli a xun. Malekɛe naxa e maso Isa ra, e a sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a xa wali fɔlɔfe Galile bɔxi ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-20">Maraki 1:14-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luki 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Isa to a mɛ a Yaya bara sa geeli, a naxa gbilen Galile bɔxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />A naxa keli Nasarɛti taa kui, a sa sabati Kapɛrɛnamu, taa nde naxan nu na baa dɛ ra, Sabulon nun Nafatali bɔxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Na naxa raba alako Annabi Esayi xa masenyi xa kamali,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Sabulon nun Nafatali bɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">naxee na kira ra sigafe baa dɛ ra Yurudɛn naakiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">wo findixi Galile bɔxi nan na naxan na si gbɛtɛe bɛlɛxɛ.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Ɲamanɛ naxan dɔxɔxi dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">e bara naiyalanyi belebele to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Naxee dɔxɔxi faxɛ xa dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">naiyalanyi bara mini e bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Keli na tɛmui ma, Isa naxa kawandi ti fɔlɔ, a nu a fala, «Wo tuubi, barima Ala xa mangɛya niini bara makɔrɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a fɔxirabirɛ singee xilife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maraki 1:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luki 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Isa to nu ɲɛrɛfe Galile baa dɛ ra, a naxa xɛmɛ firin to e na yɛlɛ wolife. Yɛxɛsuxuie nan nu e ra, Simɔn, naxan xili Piyɛri, a nun a xunya Andire. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo bira n fɔxɔ ra. Tɛmui dangixi wo nu yɛxɛ nan suxuma, kɔnɔ yakɔsi n a niyama wo xa nu mixie nan sɔtɔ n bɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />E naxa e xa yɛlɛe lu na keren na, e bira Isa fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />E to siga, e naxa xɛmɛ firin gbɛtɛ to, Sebede xa di Yaki nun a xunya Yaya. E nu na yɛlɛe madɛgɛfe kunkui kui e baba Sebede fɛ ma. Isa naxa e xili, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />e fan naxa kunkui nun e baba lu na keren na, e bira Isa fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa mixie kawandife nun furemae rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luki 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Na xanbi Isa naxa Galile bɔxi birin isa fɔlɔ. A nu mixie xaranma e xa salidee kui, a nu e kawandi Ala xa mangɛya niini xa xibaaru fanyi ra, a nu furema mɔɔli birin nayalan ɲama ya ma. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />A xili naxa te Siriya bɔxi birin ma. Mixie naxa fa furema mɔɔli birin na a xɔn ma. E nu fama mixie ra naxee nu na tɔɔrɔfe a ɲaaxi ra, ɲinnɛ nu naxee fɔxɔ ra, bira fure nu na naxee ma, a nun namatɛe. Isa nu e birin nayalanma. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Ɲama gbegbe naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra kelife Galile bɔxi ma, Taa Fu bɔxi, Darisalamu, Yudaya, nun bɔxi naxan na Yurudɛn naakiri ma.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Isa xa kawandi geya fari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13">Maraki 3:13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:12-13">Luki 6:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Isa to ɲama to, a naxa te geya fari, a a magoro. A fɔxirabirɛe naxa e makɔrɛ a ra. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />A naxa masenyi ti fɔlɔ e bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ala sɛɛwɛ fima naxee ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-26">Luki 6:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee e yɛtɛ magoroma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">barima e fama nɛ sode Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee wama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">barima e fama nɛ madundude.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee diɲɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">bɔxi findima e tan nan kɛ ra.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee wama tinxinyi xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">alɔ kaamɛtɔɛ wama donse xɔn ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">barima e a sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee kinikinima e booree ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">barima Ala kinikinima nɛ e fan ma.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee bɔɲɛ fiixɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">barima e Ala toma nɛ a xa fonisireya kui.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee lanyi fenma e nun mixie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">barima e xili falama nɛ Ala xa die.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee ɲaxankataxi tinxinyi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">barima e soma nɛ Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma.»<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />«Sɛɛwɛ na wo bɛ e na wo konbi, e na wo ɲaxankata, e na wule nun fe kobi mɔɔli birin fala wo xun ma n ma fe ra. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Wo xa ɲɛlɛxin, wo xa sɛɛwa, barima wo baraayi gboma nɛ ariyanna. Beenun wo xa bari, e namiɲɔnmɛe fan ɲaxankata na ki nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Fɔxɛ nun naiyalanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maraki 9:50</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:21">4:21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luki 14:34-35</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:16">8:16</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Wo maniyaxi fɔxɛ nan na yi duniɲa adamadie ya ma, kɔnɔ xa fɔxɛ mɛxɛmɛxɛnyi bara ba, a fa mɛxɛmɛxɛnma di? A tide yo mu na kɔrɛ, fo a woli tande, mixie ɲɛrɛ a fari. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Wo maniyaxi naiyalanyi nan na yi duniɲa adamadie ya ma. Taa naxan dɔxɔxi geya fari, na mu nɔma nɔxunde. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Lanpui mu radɛxɛma a xa dɔxɔ debe bun ma. A dɔxɔma lanpui dɔxɔse nan fari alako a xa banxi kui iyalan birin bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Wo xa naiyalanyi fan xa yanba na ki adamadie ya ma, alako e xa wo xa kɛwali fanyie to, e wo Baba matɔxɔ naxan na ariyanna.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Annabi Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Wo naxa a maɲɔxun a n faxi nɛ n xa Tawureta Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa sɛriyɛ ba a i. N mu faxi e bade xɛ, n faxi nɛ alako n xa e rakamali. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, danmi koore nun bɔxi na na, hali sigirɛ keren mu bama Ala xa sɛriyɛ ra, fo a birin kamali. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Na kui, mixi yo Ala xa yaamari keren matandi, na yaamari xurun kiyoki, a man fa mixi gbɛtɛe ratantan na kui, a kanyi fan xili xurunma nɛ birin bɛ Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. Kɔnɔ mixi yo Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatu, a mixi gbɛtɛe xaran na ra, na kanyi xunnakeli nan sɔtɔma Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />N xa a fala wo bɛ, xa wo xa tinxinyi mu dangi sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛnie gbe ra, wo mu soma Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma abadan.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Faxɛ tife, xɔnɛ, nun lanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:25">Maraki 11:25</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luki 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Wo a kolon wo benbae yamari naxan na, ‹Wo naxa faxɛ ti. Faxɛti makiitima nɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Kɔnɔ n tan xa a fala wo bɛ, naxan yo bɔɲɛ na te a ngaxakerenyi xili ma, na kanyi makiitima nɛ. Naxan na a fala ngaxakerenyi bɛ, ‹I tan dugula›, na kanyi makiitima nɛ kiitisa xungbee ya i. Naxan na a fala a bɛ, ‹I tan xaxilitare!›, na kanyi wolima nɛ yahannama tɛ xɔɔra.»<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />«Na kui, xa wo bara siga sɛrɛxɛ bade, wo fa ratu a wo ngaxakerenyi xɔnɔxi wo ma fe nde ma, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />wo xa wo xa sɛrɛxɛ lu sɛrɛxɛbade fɛ ma sinden, wo siga wo ngaxakerenyi yire. Wo xa lanyi xiri wo nun wo ngaxakerenyi tagi, wo fa gbilen wo xa sɛrɛxɛ bade.»<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />«I xa kata wo nun i kalamuma xa lan sinnanyi ma, wo na kira xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ. Xa na mu a ra a i xaninma kiitisa yire, kiitisa fan i so kɔsibili yi ra, na fan i sa geeli. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />N xa nɔndi fala i bɛ, i mu minima mɛnni fo i kɔbiri birin fi han batanka dɔnxɔɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yɛnɛ nun mixi ratantanse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:8-9">Matiyu 18:8-9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Maraki 9:43</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:47-48">9:47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Wo a kolon wo benbae yamari naxan na, ‹Wo naxa yɛnɛ raba.› <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Kɔnɔ n tan xa a fala wo bɛ, naxan yo a ya ti ginɛ nde ra milɛ kui, na kanyi bara gɛ yɛnɛ rabade a bɔɲɛ kui. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Xa i yirefan ya findima i ratantanse ra, a ba na, a wɔlɛ. Fate yire nde bafe na, na fisa dinɛ i fate gundi birin wolife yahannama. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Xa i yirefan bɛlɛxɛ findima i ratantanse ra, a bolon, a wɔlɛ. Fate salonse nde bolonfe, na fisa dinɛ i fate gundi birin wolife yahannama.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Xɛmɛ nun ginɛ fatanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:7-9">Matiyu 19:7-9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:4-5">Maraki 10:4-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:10-12">10:10-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luki 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«A man masenxi nɛ, ‹Naxan wama mɛɛfe a xa ginɛ ra, a xa fatan kɛɛdi so a yi ra.› <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Kɔnɔ n tan xa a fala wo bɛ, naxan yo mɛɛ a xa ginɛ ra, xa a xa ginɛ mu yɛnɛ xa rabaxi, na kanyi bara a niya na ginɛ xa findi yɛnɛla ra a na dɔxɔ xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ. Xɛmɛ naxan fan na ginɛ dɔxɔma e mɛɛxi naxan na, a fan bara findi yɛnɛla ra.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Marakali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Wo a kolon wo benbae yamari naxan na, ‹Wo naxa wo xa marakali kana, wo xa a rakamali nɛ Marigi bɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Kɔnɔ n tan xa a fala wo bɛ, wo naxa wo kali feo! Wo naxa wo kali koore ra, barima Ala xa kibanyi nan a ra. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Wo naxa wo kali bɔxi ra, barima Ala sanyi tide na a ra. Wo naxa wo kali Darisalamu ra, barima Mangɛ Xungbe xa taa nan a ra. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Wo naxa wo kali wo yɛtɛ xunyi ra, barima wo mu nɔma xunsɛxɛ keren nafugade, wo mu nɔma a fɔɔrɔde. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Wo xa nɔndi fala. Xa iyo nan a ra, wo xa a fala ‹iyo›. Xa ade nan a ra, wo xa a fala ‹ade›. Sese sa na xun ma, a fatanxi Sentanɛ nan ma.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Gbeɲɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luki 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Wo a kolon wo yamari naxan na, ‹Wo xa ya ɲɔxɔ ya ra, wo xa ɲinyi ɲɔxɔ ɲinyi ra.› <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Kɔnɔ n tan xa a fala wo bɛ, wo naxa mixi kobi gere. Xa mixi nde wo xɛrɛ garin, wo xa boore sɛɛti fan ti a bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Xa mixi nde wama wo xaninfe kiiti banxi, alako a xa donma ba wo yi ra, wo xa wo xa guba fan lu a yi. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Xa mixi nde wo karaxan wo xa a mati ɲɛrɛ kui kilo keren, wo xa a mati kilo firin. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Naxan na i makula, i xa a ki. Naxan wama se nde yofufe i ma, i naxa tondi a bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yaxuie xanufe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luki 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">6:32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Wo a kolon wo yamarixi naxan na, ‹Wo xa wo boore xanu, wo xa wo yaxui xɔn.› <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Kɔnɔ n tan xa a fala wo bɛ, wo xa wo yaxuie xanu, wo xa Ala maxandi mixie bɛ naxee wo ɲaxankatama. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Na kui, wo findima wo Baba xa die ra naxan na ariyanna, naxan kuye ibama tinxintɔɛe nun tinxintaree bɛ, naxan tunɛ ragoroma mixi fanyie nun mixi kobie bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Xa wo sa mixie gbansan nan xanuma, naxee wo fan xanuxi, wo baraayi mundun sɔtɔma na kui? Hali duuti maxili kobie na mɔɔli rabama. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Xa wo sa wo ngaxakerenyie gbansan nan xɛɛbuma, wo munfe rabafe naxan findi fe nɛɛnɛ ra na kui? Hali kaafirie na mɔɔli rabama. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Na kui, wo xa tinxinyi nun marafanyi xa kamali, alɔ wo naxan toxi wo Baba ra naxan na ariyanna.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s2">Mixi kife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Wo naxa fe fanyi raba mixie ya tode ra e xa wo xa tinxinyi to, xa na mu a ra wo mu baraayi yo sɔtɔma wo Baba ra, naxan na ariyanna. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Na kui, i nɛ mixi kima, i naxa a sigi sa duniɲa birin bɛ alɔ filankafuie a rabama ki naxɛ salide nun taa ma, alako mixie xa e matɔxɔ. N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, e bara gɛ e xa wali sare birin sɔtɔde. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />I nɛ mixi kima i yirefanyi ra, kɔɔla naxa a kolon. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />I xa mixi ki suturɛ nan na. Na kui, i Baba Ala naxan gundo birin kolon, a fama nɛ na sare ragbilende i ma.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luki 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />«Wo nɛ salima, wo naxa lu alɔ filankafuie naxee salima, e tixi salidee kui nun kira dɛ ra alako mixie xa e to. N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, e bara gɛ e xa wali sare birin sɔtɔde. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Kɔnɔ i tan nɛ salima, siga i xa banxi yire nde nɔxunyi kui, i naadɛ ragali, i Ala maxandi naxan mu toma. Na kui, i Baba Ala naxan gundo fe birin toxi, a fama nɛ i sare fide.»<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />«Wo nɛ Ala maxandima, wo naxa wo xa wɔyɛnyi rawuya fufafu, alɔ kaafiri naxee laxi a ra a e xa duba suxuma e xa wɔyɛnyi radiganxie nan saabui ra. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Wo naxa lu alɔ e tan, barima wo Baba Ala wo hayi kolon beenun wo xa a maxandi.»<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />«Wo lan wo xa sali yi ki nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‹Muxu Baba naxan na ariyanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">duniɲa birin xa i xili sɛniyɛnxi kolon.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />I xa mangɛya xa fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">I sago xa raba duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">alɔ a rabama ariyanna ki naxɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Baloe fi muxu ma to lɔxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:11">muxu hayi na naxan ma.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Diɲɛ muxu xa yunubie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">alɔ muxu fan diɲɛxi mixie haakɛe ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">naxee bara fe kobi niya muxu ra.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />I naxa muxu ti maratantanyi kira xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">i xa muxu ratanga Sentanɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">I tan nan gbe na mangɛya, sɛnbɛ, nun binyɛ ra abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Amina.›»<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />«Xa wo diɲɛ mixie haakɛe ma, wo Baba naxan na ariyanna, a fan diɲɛma nɛ wo ma, <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />kɔnɔ xa wo mu diɲɛ mixie ma, wo Baba naxan na ariyanna, a fan mu diɲɛma wo xa yunubie ma.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Sunyi suxufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Wo nɛ sunyi suxuma, wo naxa wo yatagi ixɔnɔ alɔ filankafuie e yatagi ixɔnɔma ki naxɛ, mixie xa a kolon a e na sunyi. N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, e bara gɛ e xa wali sare birin sɔtɔde. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Kɔnɔ i tan nɛ sunyi suxuma, i xa ture sa i xunyi ma, i i yatagi maxa, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />alako mixie naxa a kolon a i na sunyi. Na kui, i Baba Ala naxan mu toma, naxan man gundo fe birin toxi, a fama nɛ i sare fide.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Harige</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:33-36">Luki 11:33-36</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 16:13">16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Wo naxa wo harige malan duniɲa ma, nimasee nun xɔrixɔri a xun nakanama dɛnnaxɛ, xa na mu a ra muɲɛtie nɔma a muɲade banxi kui dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Wo xa wo harige malan ariyanna nɛ, nimasee nun xɔrixɔri mu kanari sama dɛnnaxɛ, muɲɛtie fan mu muɲɛ tima dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Wo harige na dɛnnaxɛ, wo bɔɲɛ fan luma naa nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Ya nan na fate xa lanpui ra. Xa i ya fan, i fate birin iyalanma nɛ, <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />kɔnɔ xa i ya mu fan, i fate luma dimi nan kui. Na kui, xa i xa naiyalanyi bara findi dimi ra, na dimi ifɔɔrɔ de!»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Mixi yo mu nɔma lude marigi firin xa yaamari bun ma, barima a fama marigi keren xɔnde, a boore maxanu. A xirima keren na, a boore rabolo. Wo mu nɔma Ala nun naafuli batude tɛmui keren.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kɔntɔfili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-32">Luki 12:22-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Na nan a toxi, n xa a fala wo bɛ, wo naxa kɔntɔfili baloe xa fe ra wo hayi na naxan ma yi duniɲɛigiri kui, xa na mu a ra, dugie xa fe ra wo naxee ragoroma wo fate ma. Wo xa duniɲɛigiri tide mu gbo donse bɛ? Wo fate tide mu gbo dugie bɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Wo xɔnie mato koore ma. E mu sansi sima, e mu xɛ xabama, e mu donse ragatama bilie kui, kɔnɔ wo Baba naxan na ariyanna, a e baloma. Wo tan mu dangi na xɔnie ra? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Nde nɔma hali xi keren sade a xa simaya xun a xa kɔntɔfili saabui ra? <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Munfe ra wo kɔntɔfilima wo xa sosee xa fe ra? Wo sansi fuge tofanyie mato, e minima wula sansie ma ki naxɛ. E mu walima, e mu woligɛsɛ yailanma, <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />kɔnɔ n xa a fala wo bɛ, hali mangɛ Sulemani xa dariyɛ birin kui, a xa sosee mu nu tofan alɔ na sansi fuge keren. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Xa Ala sansi mɛɛnima yi ki nɛ, sansi naxan na na to, tina a gan, a mu mɛɛnima wo fan ma? Wo xa danxaniya xurun!»<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />«Na kui, wo naxa kɔntɔfili a falafe ra, ‹Muxu munse donma? Muxu munse minma? Muxu munse ragoroma muxu ma?› <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kaafirie birama na fe mɔɔli nan tun fɔxɔ ra. Anun, wo Baba naxan na ariyanna, a a kolon wo hayi na na se birin ma. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Na kui, wo xa Ala xa mangɛya niini nun a xa tinxinyi nan singe fen, a na se dɔnxɔɛ birin fan fima nɛ wo ma. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Wo naxa kɔntɔfili tina xa fe ra, barima tina a ɲɔxɔ sama a yɛtɛ xɔn. Lɔxɔɛ birin nun a xa tɔɔrɛ nan a ra.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s2">Wuri fuɲi nun xebenyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-42">Luki 6:37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />«Wo naxa wo yɛtɛ findi wo boore adama kɛwalie makiitima ra, alako kiiti naxa kana wo fan na Ala yi. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Wo mixi makiitima ki naxɛ, wo fan makiitima na ki nɛ. Wo maniyase naxan nawalima booree bɛ, na nan nawalima wo fan bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Munfe ra i wuri fuɲi toma i ngaxakerenyi ya ma, a fa li i mu xebenyi toxi naxan na i tan yɛtɛ ya ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />I nɔma a falade i ngaxakerenyi bɛ di, ‹A lu n xa wuri fuɲi ba i ya ma,› xa a sa li xebenyi nan na i tan yɛtɛ ya ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />I tan filankafui, xebenyi nan singe ba i yɛtɛ ya ma. Na ba xanbi, i nɔma nɛ se igbɛde a fanyi ra, alako i xa wuri fuɲi ba i ngaxakerenyi fan ya ma.»<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Se sɛniyɛnxi sofe baree yi ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />«Wo naxa se sɛniyɛnxi so baree yi ra, xa na mu a ra e e ya rafindima nɛ wo ma, e wo maxin. Wo naxa gɛmɛ tofanyie woli xɔsɛe bun ma, xa na mu a ra e e maboronma nan tui.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Baba Ala maxandife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luki 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Wo maxandi ti, wo a sɔtɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 7:7">Wo fenyi ti, wo a toma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 7:7">Wo naadɛ kɔnkɔn, a rabima nɛ wo bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Mixi naxan birin maxandi tima, a a sɔtɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 7:8">Mixi naxan fenyi tima, a a toma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 7:8">Mixi naxan naadɛ kɔnkɔnma, a rabima nɛ a bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />«Babɛ mundun na wo ya ma naxan xa di taami maxɔrinma a ma, a sa gɛmɛ so a yi ra? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Xa na mu a ra, a bɔximase so a yi, a xa di na a maxɔrin yɛxɛ ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Xa wo tan mixi kobie fata se fanyie fide wo xa die ma, wo Baba Ala naxan na ariyanna, a dangi wo ra pon! A fe fanyie fima nɛ a maxandimae ma.»<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mixi lanma a xa naxan naba a boore adama bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luki 6:31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />«Wo wama mixie xa naxan birin naba wo bɛ, wo fan xa na nan naba e bɛ. Tawureta Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa Kitaabuie birin nalanxi nan na ki.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Naadɛ ixutuxi nun a igbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:23-24">Luki 13:23-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Wo xa so naadɛ ixutuxi nan na, barima naadɛ igbe mixi rasigama gbaloe nan ma. Kira naxan mixi xaninma gbaloe ma, a ɲɛrɛ mu xɔnɔ. Mixi gbegbe soma naadɛ igbe nan na, mixi gbegbe gbaloe kira nan suxuma. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Kɔnɔ naadɛ ixutuxi rabima kisi nan ma. Kira naxan mixi xaninma kisi ma, a ɲɛrɛ xɔnɔ. Mixi mu gbo naxee na naadɛ nun na kira toma.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Wuri bili kolonma a bogi nan ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luki 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Wo wo yɛtɛ ratanga wule falɛe ma naxee e yɛtɛ findixi namiɲɔnmɛe ra. E fama wɔyɛnyi ɲɔxunmɛ ra wo ma, kɔnɔ e ɲanige mu fan feo! <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Wo e kolonma e xa kɛwali nan ma. Kusu bama baagi bili kɔn na? Xɔrɛ bama tunbe bili ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Sansi fanyi bogi fanyi nan naminima, sansi kobi fan bogi kobi nan naminima. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Sansi fanyi mu nɔma bogi kobi raminide, sansi kobi fan mu nɔma bogi fanyi raminide. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Sansi naxan mu bogi fanyi raminima, a sɛgɛma nɛ, a woli tɛ i. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Na kui, wo na mixie kolonma e xa kɛwali nan ma.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Naxee mu Ala sagoe rabama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:46">Luki 6:46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Mixi naxee a falama n bɛ, ‹N Marigi, n Marigi,› e birin xa mu soma Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma, fo naxee n Baba sago rabama naxan na ariyanna. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Na lɔxɔɛ mixi gbegbe a falama nɛ n bɛ, ‹Muxu Marigi, muxu Marigi, muxu mu wɔyɛn xɛ i xili ra? Muxu mu ɲinnɛe keri xɛ i xili ra? Muxu mu kaabanako gbegbe raba xɛ i xili ra?› <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Na tɛmui n nee yaabima nɛ, ‹N mu wo kolon feo! Wo tan fe kobi rabae, wo keli n ya i.›»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Banxiti firin xa taali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luki 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Na kui, mixi naxan na n ma masenyi ramɛ, a fa a rabatu, na kanyi maniya xaxilima ra naxan a xa banxi bili ti fanye ma. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Tunɛ naxa fa, xuree naxa banbaran yɛ, foye naxa mini a nu banxi mabɔnbɔ, kɔnɔ banxi mu bira, barima a nu tixi fanye nan fari. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Kɔnɔ mixi naxan n ma masenyi ramɛ, a mu a rabatu, na kanyi maniya mixi xaxilitare ra naxan a xa banxi tixi mɛyɛnyi fari. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Tunɛ naxa fa, xuree naxa banbaran yɛ, foye naxa mini a nu banxi mabɔnbɔ, banxi fan naxa bira, a kana a ɲaaxi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Isa to gɛ yi fe birin masende, ɲama naxa kaaba a xa xaranyi ma, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />barima a mu nu luxi alɔ e xa sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe. A tan nu wɔyɛnma mangɛ sɛnbɛ nan na.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Isa kunɛ kanyi rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maraki 1:40-45</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:12-14">Luki 5:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Isa to goro geya fari, ɲama gbegbe naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Kunɛ kanyi nde naxa a maso Isa ra, a suyidi a bɛ, a a fala a bɛ, «N Marigi, xa i tin, i nɔma n nasɛniyɛnde.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Isa naxa a bɛlɛxɛ itala, a a sa kunɛ kanyi ma, a a fala a bɛ, «N tinxi. Findi mixi sɛniyɛnxi ra.» Kunɛ fure naxa ba a ma keren na. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Isa man naxa a masen a bɛ, «I naxa yi fe fala mixi yo bɛ. Siga i sa i yɛtɛ dɛntɛgɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ bɛ, i sɛrɛxɛ ba alɔ Annabi Munsa a yamarixi ki naxɛ. Na findima seedeɲɔxɔya nan na e bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔɔri xunmati xa danxaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luki 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Isa to so Kapɛrɛnamu, sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati naxa fa a yire, a a maxandi, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />«Marigi, n ma walikɛ saxi banxi, a bara namata, a ɲaxankataxi ki fanyi ra.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «N xa siga, n xa sa a rayalan.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, na binyɛ mu na n yi ra i tan xa so n ma banxi kui. I xa yaamari gbansan nan fi, n ma konyi yalanma nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />N a kolon barima n fan na mangɛ ndee nan xa yaamari bun ma, sɔɔri ndee man na n fan yi, naxee na n ma yaamari bun ma. N na a fala sɔɔri nde bɛ, ‹Siga,› a sigama nɛ. N na a fala, ‹Fa,› a fama nɛ. N na n ma konyi nde yamari, ‹Yi fe raba,› a a rabama nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Isa to na sɔɔri xa masenyi mɛ, a naxa kaaba, a fa a fala a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, n mu yi danxaniya mɔɔli toxi Isirayila bɔxi dɛdɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />N xa a fala wo bɛ, mixi gbegbe fama nɛ keli sogetede nun sogegorode biri, e e dɛge e nun Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Kɔnɔ mangɛ xa die tan wolima nɛ tande dimi kui, wa nun ɲinyi raxinyi na dɛnnaxɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Na tɛmui Isa naxa a fala sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati bɛ, «Siga, a xa raba i bɛ alɔ i laxi a ra ki naxɛ.» Na waxati kerenyi yati, sɔɔri xa konyi naxa yalan.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa mixi gbegbe rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-34">Maraki 1:21-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:31-41">Luki 4:31-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Na dangi xanbi, Isa naxa siga Piyɛri xɔnyi. A naxa Piyɛri bitanyi ginɛma to, a saxi, a fate wolenxi ki fanyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Isa to a bɛlɛxɛ suxu, fure naxa a bɛɲin keren na. A naxa keli, a fa kuri so e bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nunmare tɛmui, e naxa fa mixi gbegbe ra Isa xɔn ma ɲinnɛ nu naxee fɔxɔ ra. A naxa ɲinnɛe keri a xa wɔyɛnyi ra, a furemae birin nayalan. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Na kui, Annabi Esayi xa masenyi naxa kamali, naxan sɛbɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">«A naxa won ma tɔɔrɛ ba won ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">a won ma furee dɔxɔ a xun.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Birafe Isa fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luki 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Isa to ɲama gbegbe to a rabilinyi, a naxa a fɔxirabirɛe yamari e xa baa igiri. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔ nde naxa a maso Isa ra, a a fala a bɛ, «Karamɔxɔ, i siga dɛdɛ, n na i fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Isa naxa a yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:20">«Xulumase xima a yili kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:20">Xɔni xima a tɛɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:20">Kɔnɔ dɛdɛ mu na Adama xa Di bɛ a a xunyi sama dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />A fɔxirabirɛ nde fan naxa a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, a lu n xa siga n baba ragatade sinden.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa a yaabi, «Bira n fɔxɔ ra. A lu faxamixie xa e xa faxamixie ragata.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa foye belebele raxarafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maraki 4:35-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luki 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Isa naxa baki kunkui kui, a fɔxirabirɛe naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Foye belebele naxa keli baa ma, mɔrɔnyi nu fa sa kunkui kui. Kɔnɔ Isa tan nu na xife. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa fa a raxunu, e a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, won nakisi, won faxafe nɛ yi ki!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />A naxa e yaabi, «Wo gaaxuxi munfe ra? Wo xa danxaniya xurun!» A naxa keli, a foye nun baa yamari, baa naxa xinbeli yen! <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa kaaba, e e bore maxɔrin, «Mixi mɔɔli mundun lanxi yi ma? Hali foye nun baa, e a xui rabatuma.»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲinnɛ kanyi rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maraki 5:1-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luki 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />E to naakiri li Gadara bɔxi ma, mixi firin naxa mini gaburi longori ra ɲinnɛe nu naxee fɔxɔ ra, e sa Isa ralan. E nu magaaxu ki fanyi, mixi yo ɲan mu nu nɔma dangide na biri. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />E naxa sɔnxɔ, «Ala xa Di, i waxi munse xɔn ma muxu bɛ? I faxi be muxu ɲaxankatade nɛ beenun a lɔxɔɛ xa a li?» <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Xɔsɛ gali nu na e dɛmadonfe na longori. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ɲinnɛe naxa Isa mayandi, «Xa i sa muxu keri, muxu raso yi xɔsɛ gali.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo siga.» E naxa mini na xɛmɛ firinyie, e so na xɔsɛe i. Xɔsɛ gali birin naxa goro e gi ra tentenyi ra, e sa sin baa ma, e madula. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Naxee nu na xɔsɛe dɛmadonfe, e naxa e gi. E to so taa kui, e naxa dɛntɛgɛ sa fe ma naxan dangixi, e a fala taakae bɛ ɲinnɛe gbilenxi na xɛmɛ firin fɔxɔ ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Na tɛmui taa birin naxa mini Isa ralande. E to a to, e naxa a mayandi a xa keli e xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Namatɛ rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maraki 2:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luki 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Isa to baki kunkui kui, a naxa baa igiri, a so a xɔnyi taa kui. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Mixi ndee naxa fa namatɛ nde ra Isa xɔn ma, a saxi dagi ma. Isa to e xa danxaniya to, a naxa a fala namatɛ bɛ, «N ma di, limaniya tongo, i xa yunubie bara xafari.» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Na kui, sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔ ndee naxa a fala e bɔɲɛ ma, «Yi xɛmɛ na Ala rasɔtɔfe nɛ yi ki.» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Kɔnɔ Isa to nu e xa maɲɔxunyi kolon, a naxa a masen e bɛ, «Munfe ra maɲɔxunyi kobie na wo bɔɲɛ ma? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Wɔyɛnyi mundun sɔɔnɛya, a falafe ‹I xa yunubie bara xafari,› ka a falafe ‹Keli, i xa i ɲɛrɛ›? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />N xa a masen wo bɛ a Adama xa Di nɔma yunubi xafaride duniɲa ma.» Isa naxa a masen namatɛ bɛ, «Keli, i xa i xa dagi tongo, i xa siga i xɔnyi.» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Namatɛ naxa keli, a siga a xɔnyi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ɲama to na to, e naxa gaaxu, e nu fa Ala matɔxɔ, naxan na sɛnbɛ mɔɔli fixi adamadie ma.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiyu birafe Isa fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maraki 2:13-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luki 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Isa to keli na, a naxa xɛmɛ nde to naxan xili Matiyu, a dɔxɔxi duuti maxilide. Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Bira n fɔxɔ ra.» Matiyu naxa keli, a bira a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Lɔxɔ nde Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe nu na e dɛgefe Matiyu xɔnyi. Duuti maxilie nun yunubitɔɛ gbegbe naxa fa, e birin naxa e dɛge fɔlɔ yire keren. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Farisɛnie to na to, e naxa Isa fɔxirabirɛe maxɔrin, «Munfe ra wo karamɔxɔ nun duuti maxilie nun yunubitɔɛe e dɛgema yire keren?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Isa to na mɛ, a naxa a fala, «Mixi yalanxi hayi mu na seriba ma. Furema nan hayi na seriba ma. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Wo siga, wo sa fahaamui sɔtɔ yi masenyi ma, ‹Hinnɛ rafan n ma dangife sɛrɛxɛ ra.› N mu faxi tinxintɔɛe xa xilide. N faxi yunubitɔɛe nan xilide.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa maxɔrinfe sunyi ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maraki 2:18-22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luki 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Na tɛmui Annabi Yaya fɔxirabirɛe naxa fa Isa yire, e a maxɔrin, «Munfe ra muxu tan nun Farisɛnie sunyi suxuma, kɔnɔ i fɔxirabirɛe tan mu sunma?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Ginɛfenyi xa futixiri xulunyi, a booree nɔma sunnunde a na e fɛ ma tɛmui naxɛ? Lɔxɔɛ fama, ginɛfenyi bama nɛ e yi ra. Na waxati tan, e sunyi suxuma nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Mixi yo mu dugi fori lonpoma dugi nɛɛnɛ ra, xa na mu a ra na dugi nɛɛnɛ xuntunyi nan dugi fori ibɛndunma, dugi ibɔɔ dangi a singe ra. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Mixi man mu wɛni nɛɛnɛ sama lɛbɛ fori kui, xa na mu a ra na wɛni nɛɛnɛ na funtu, wɛni lɛbɛ fori bulama nɛ, wɛni fili, a sase fan kana. Wɛni nɛɛnɛ sama lɛbɛ nɛɛnɛ nan kui, alako wɛni yo, wɛni sase yo, e birin xa ragata a fanyi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ginɛdimɛdi rakelife faxɛ ma</para>
  <para style="s">nun ginɛ gbɛtɛ rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maraki 5:21-43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luki 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Isa to nu na na fee masenfe e bɛ, mangɛ nde naxa fa, a suyidi Isa bɛ, a a fala a bɛ, «N ma di ginɛ baxi faxade ya, kɔnɔ xa i siga, i naxa i bɛlɛxɛ sa a ma, a man kelima nɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Isa naxa keli, e nun a fɔxirabirɛe naxa bira na mangɛ fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Na tɛmui, ginɛ nde naxan xa kike wali mu nu a itima ɲɛ fu nun firin bun ma, a naxa fa Isa xanbi ra, a a bɛlɛxɛ din a xa donma sanbunyi ra, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />barima a nu a falafe a yɛtɛ ma, «Xa n nɔ n bɛlɛxɛ dinde Isa xa donma gbansan na, n yalanma nɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Isa to a mafindi, a ginɛ to, a naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ma di, limaniya, i xa danxaniya bara i rayalan.» Keren na, ginɛ naxa yalan.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Isa to so mangɛ xɔnyi, a naxa ɲama li naa, e sɔnxɔfe, xule femae fan bara fa ɲɔn yire. A naxa a fala e bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />«Wo siga, barima yi ginɛdimɛdi mu faxaxi. A na xife nɛ.» E naxa yo a ma, e a mayele. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />A to ɲama ramini tande, a naxa so banxi kui. A naxa ginɛdimɛdi bɛlɛxɛ suxu, ginɛdimɛdi naxa keli. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Na xibaaru naxa yensen na yire birin na.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa dɔnxui firin nayalanfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Isa to keli mɛnni, dɔnxui firin naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra, e nu e xui ite a bɛ, «Dawuda xa Di, kinikini muxu ma!» <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Isa to so banxi, dɔnxuie naxa e maso a ra. A naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo laxi a ra a n nɔma wo rayalande?» E naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, Marigi.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Isa naxa a bɛlɛxɛe sa e ya ma, a a fala e bɛ, «Wo waxɔnfe xa raba wo bɛ alɔ wo laxi a ra ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />E yae naxa rabi keren na. Isa naxa a matintin e ra a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, «Mixi yo naxa yi fe kolon.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Kɔnɔ e to mini, e naxa siga Isa xa fe fala ra na bɔxi yire birin.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boboe rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:14-15">Luki 11:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe to nu kelife naa, mixi nde naxa fa xɛmɛ nde ra a xɔn ma ɲinnɛ nu bara naxan findi boboe ra. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Isa to na ɲinnɛ keri, boboe naxa wɔyɛn. Ɲama naxa kaaba, e a fala, «Yi fe mɔɔli singe mu nu to Isirayila bɔxi ma.» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Kɔnɔ Farisɛnie tan naxa a fala, «A ɲinnɛe kerima ɲinnɛ mangɛ nan saabui ra.»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa kinikinife ɲama ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:6">Maraki 6:6</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:34">6:34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:1">Luki 8:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Isa naxa taae birin iɲɛrɛ, a xungbe nun a xuri. A nu mixie xaranma e xa salidee kui, a nu e kawandi Ala xa mangɛya xa xibaaru fanyi ra, a nu furema mɔɔli birin nayalan. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />A nu ɲama toma tɛmui naxɛ, a nu kinikinima e ma, barima sɛnbɛ nun limaniya birin nu baxi e yi. E nu luxi nɛ alɔ yɛxɛɛ naxee makantama mu na. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Na kui, a naxa a fala a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «Xɛ xaba wali belebele nan na, kɔnɔ walikɛe tan xurun. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Wo xɛ kanyi maxandi alako a xa walikɛe rasanba a xa xɛ xabade.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Isa xa xɛɛra fu nun firinyie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maraki 3:13-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luki 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Isa naxa a fɔxirabirɛ fu nun firinyie xili, a nɔɛ so e yi ra alako e xa nɔ ɲinnɛe keride mixie fɔxɔ ra, e man xa nɔ furema mɔɔli birin nayalande.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Na xɛɛra fu nun firinyi xilie nan ya: a singe, Simɔn, naxan man xili Piyɛri, nun a xunya Andire, Sebede xa di Yaki, nun a xunya Yaya, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipu nun Barotolome, Tomasi nun Matiyu duuti maxili, Alifa xa di Yaki nun Tadayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simɔn naxan xili Seloti, nun Yudasi Isikariyoti naxan Isa yanfa.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a xa xɛɛra fu nun firinyie xɛɛfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maraki 6:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luki 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Isa naxa yi xɛmɛ fu nun firinyie xɛɛ yi yaamari ra: «Wo naxa siga mixie yire Yuwifie mu naxee ra, wo naxa so Samarikae xa taae kui. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Wo xa siga Isirayilakae nan xɔn, naxee luxi alɔ yɛxɛɛ lɔɛxie. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Wo xa kawandi ti kira xɔn a Ala xa mangɛya niini bara makɔrɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Wo xa furemae rayalan, wo xa faxamixie rakeli, wo xa kunɛ kanyie rasɛniyɛn, wo xa ɲinnɛe keri. Wo kixi nɛ, wo mu sese fi. Wo fan xa mixi ki na ki. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Wo naxa xɛɛma, gbeti, xa na mu a ra kɔbiri xanin wo xun ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Wo man naxa gbɔnfɔɛ, donma firin nde, sankiri, xa na mu a ra xuli xanin wo xun ma. A lanma baloe xa fi walikɛ ma.»<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Wo na so taa naxan kui, wo xa mixi fanyi nde fen naxan wo yigiyama, wo lu naa han wo siga taa gbɛtɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Wo na so mixie xɔnyi, wo xa e xɛɛbu. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Xa na fɔxɔɛ mixie fan, Ala xa wo xa duba suxu e xa fe ra. Kɔnɔ xa naakae mu fan, Ala naxa na duba suxu. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Xa mixie mu tin wo rasɛnɛde, xa na mu a ra e tondi e tuli matide wo xa masenyi ra, wo nɛ kelima na banxi xa na mu a ra na taa kui, wo xa mɛnni bɛndɛ rakɔnkɔn wo sanyie ra. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, kiiti sa lɔxɔɛ, kiiti fanma Sodoma nun Gomora taakae ra dangife na taa mixie ra.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa fɔxirabirɛe fama ɲaxankatade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maraki 13:9-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luki 12:11-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:12-19">21:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />«Wo wo tuli mati, n na wo xɛɛfe nɛ alɔ yɛxɛɛ naxee soma wula baree tagi. Na kui, wo xa kɔɔta alɔ yere, wo yuge xa fan alɔ turunna xɔni. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Wo xa wo yɛtɛ matanga mixie ma, barima e wo soma nɛ kiitisae yi ra, e wo bɔnbɔma nɛ sɛbɛrɛ ra e xa salidee kui, <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />e wo xaninma nɛ gominae nun mangɛe yire n ma fe ra. Na kui, wo findima nɛ n ma seedee ra e tan bɛ, a nun si gbɛtɛe bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />E na wo so nee yi ra, wo naxa kɔntɔfili wo xa masenyi xa fe ra, wo naxan falama nun wo a falama ki naxɛ, barima na birin fima nɛ wo ma na waxati yati. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Wo tan xa mu wɔyɛnma, wo Baba Ala Xaxili nan wɔyɛnma wo saabui ra.»<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />«Mixi fama a ngaxakerenyi yanfade, a a sa mixie bɛlɛxɛ, e xa a faxa. Babɛ fan na mɔɔli niyama a xa di ra, die fan kelima nɛ e barimae xili ma, e xa e faxa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Mixi birin fama wo xɔnde n xili xa fe ra, kɔnɔ naxan na wakili han a raɲɔnyi, na kanyi kisima nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Xa e wo ɲaxankata yire nde, wo xa wo gi, wo siga taa gbɛtɛ. N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, wo mu gɛma Isirayila taa birin iɲɛrɛde a fa lu Adama xa Di mu fa.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Taalibi mu dangima a karamɔxɔ ra, konyi fan mu dangima a marigi ra. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />A lanma taalibi xa lu alɔ a karamɔxɔ, konyi fan xa lu alɔ a marigi. Xa fɔxɔɛ xunyi xili fala ɲinnɛ Bɛlɛsɛbulu, e naxan falama a xa fɔxɔɛ mixie xun ma, a ɲan dangima na ra.»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gaaxufe Ala ya ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:38">Maraki 8:38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:26">Luki 9:26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:2-9">12:2-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Wo naxa gaaxu mixie ya ra, barima fefe nɔxunxi mu na naxan mu fama makɛnɛnde, gundo yo mu na naxan mu fama kolonde. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />N naxan falama wo bɛ kɔɛ ra, wo xa na masen yanyi ra. Wo naxan mɛma makɔyikɔyi ra, wo xa duniɲa birin nakolon a ra. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Wo naxa gaaxu mixie ya ra naxee nɔma mixi fate bɛndɛ nan tun faxade, a fa li e mu nɔma wo nii tan masɔtɔde. Wo xa gaaxu Ala nan ya ra, naxan nɔma fate bɛndɛ nun nii sɔntɔde yahannama. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Turunna firin xa mu sarama batanka keren na? Kɔnɔ hali xɔni di keren mu birama bɔxi ma xa wo Baba Ala sago mu a ra. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Wo xunsɛxɛ yati kɔntixi. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Na kui, wo naxa gaaxu, barima wo tide gbo dangi turunna xɔni gali ra.»<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Mixi yo naxan n kolonma a Marigi ra adamadie ya xɔri, n fan na kanyi kolonma n Baba ya xɔri ariyanna. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Kɔnɔ naxan na tondi n kolonde a Marigi ra adamadie ya ma, n fan tondima nɛ na kanyi rakolonde n Baba ra naxan na ariyanna.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa fɔxirabirɛe nun tɔɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luki 12:51-53</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:23-24">9:23-24</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 8:34-35">Maraki 8:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Wo naxa a maɲɔxun a n faxi bɔɲɛsa nan na duniɲa. N mu faxi bɔɲɛsa xa ra, n faxi santidɛgɛma nan na. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />N faxi fatanyi nan na di xɛmɛ nun a baba tagi, di ginɛ nun a nga tagi, mamadi nun a mama tagi. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Mixi ngaxakerenyie nan findima a yaxuie ra. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Mixi naxan a baba nun a nga xanuma dangife n tan na, na kanyi mu daxa a xa lu n sɛɛti ma. Mixi naxan a xa di xanuma dangife n tan na, na kanyi mu daxa a xa lu n sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Xa mixi naxan mu tin tɔɔrɛ nun faxɛ ra, a mu bira n fɔxɔ ra, na kanyi mu daxa a xa lu n sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mixi naxan wama a yɛtɛ rakisife, na kanyi lɔɛma nɛ. Naxan a yɛtɛ ralɔɛma n tan ma fe ra, na kanyi kisima nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa fɔxirabirɛe rasɛnɛfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:37">Maraki 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 9:41">41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luki 9:48</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yaya 13:20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Mixi naxan na wo rasɛnɛ, a n tan nan nasɛnɛxi. Mixi naxan na n nasɛnɛ, a n xɛɛma nan nasɛnɛxi. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Mixi naxan na namiɲɔnmɛ rasɛnɛ a xa namiɲɔnmɛɲa ma, a baraayi sɔtɔma nɛ alɔ namiɲɔnmɛ. Mixi naxan na tinxintɔɛ rasɛnɛ a xa tinxinyi ma, a baraayi sɔtɔma nɛ alɔ tinxintɔɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mixi naxan na hali ye xinbeli pɔɔti ya keren fi yi mixi xuri keren ma a to findixi n fɔxirabirɛ ra, n xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, na kanyi mu ganma a baraayi ra muku.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Yaya xa maxɔrinyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luki 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Isa to gɛ yi yaamarie fide a fɔxirabirɛ fu nun firinyie ma, a naxa keli mɛnni, a siga Yuwifie xa taae alako a xa mixie xaran, a e kawandi.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Annabi Yaya to Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa fe mɛ geeli kui, a naxa a fɔxirabirɛ ndee xɛɛ Isa ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />E naxa a maxɔrin, «I findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan na naxan lanma a xa fa, ka muxu xa mixi gbɛtɛ nan mamɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo fe naxan mɛxi nun wo fe naxan toxi, wo sa na dɛntɛgɛ sa Yaya bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Dɔnxuie se toma, namatɛe ɲɛrɛma, kunɛ kanyie yalanma, tulixɔrie fe mɛma, faxamixie kelima, fuxarilae kawandima xibaaru fanyi ra. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ naxan mu siikɛma n ma fe ra.»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Annabi Yaya fɔxirabirɛe to siga, Isa naxa ɲama maxɔrin Yaya xa fe ma, «Wo siga munse matode wula i? Kale, foye naxan namaxama? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Xa na mu a ra, wo siga munse matode? Dugi tofanyi kanyi? Dugi tofanyi kanyie toma mangɛ banxie nan kui. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Wo fa siga munse matode? Namiɲɔnmɛ? Iyo, n xa a fala wo bɛ, a ɲan dangi namiɲɔnmɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />A tan nan xa fe sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, ‹N fama n ma xɛɛra rasanbade i ya ra alako a xa kira yailan i bɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, ginɛ yo mu di bari naxan dangi Yaya Xunxa ra. Kɔnɔ n man xa a fala wo bɛ, mixi naxan na Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma, a xurun kiyoki, a fan dangi Yaya ra. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kabi Yaya Xunxa xa waxati han to, Ala xa mangɛya sɛnbɛ nan tun sɔtɔma. Sɛnbɛmae nan luma a niini bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Namiɲɔnmɛe birin nun Tawureta Munsa bara Ala xa mangɛya niini xa fe fala han Annabi Yaya waxati. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Xa wo tinma nɔndi ra, wo xa a kolon Kitaabui to a fala a Annabi Eliya gbilenma fa ra, a nu Yaya nan ma fe falafe. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Xa wo tuli fe mɛma, wo xa wo tuli mati yi masenyi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />«N nɔma to mixie misaalide munse ra? E maniyaxi dimɛdie nan na naxee dɔxɔxi taa kui, e nu a fala e booree bɛ,<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‹Muxu bara xule fe wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">kɔnɔ wo mu fare boronxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">Muxu bara ɲɔn bɛɛti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">kɔnɔ wo mu sunnunxi.›»<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />«Annabi Yaya to nu sunma, e naxa a fala a xa fe ra, ‹Ɲinnɛ na a fɔxɔ ra.› <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Adama xa Di to fa, a tan mu tondi sigade xulunyi yire. Na kui, e bara a fala, ‹Furi ɲaaxi siisila mato! E nun duuti maxilie nun yunubitɔɛe nan a ra!› Kɔnɔ xaxilimaya kolonma a kɛwali nan ma.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taa danxaniyataree xa gbaloe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:15">Matiyu 10:15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:12-15">Luki 10:12-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Na tɛmui Isa naxa xɔnɔ mixie ma naxee nu sabatixi taae kui a kaabanako gbegbe rabaxi dɛnnaxɛ, barima e mu tuubi. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />«Gbaloe na wo bɛ, Korasinkae! Gbaloe na wo fan bɛ, Betesayidakae! Kaabanako naxee raba wo tagi, xa nee sa raba Tire nun Sidɔn nɛ nu, a a lima e tan bara tuubi nu a rakuya, e sunnun donma ragoro e ma, e tɛ xube maso e ma e xa tuubi tɔnxuma ra. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Na nan a ra n xa a fala wo bɛ, kiiti sa lɔxɔɛ xɔrɔxɔma wo tan ma dangi Tirekae nun Sidɔnkae ra. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />I tan Kapɛrɛnamu go, i ɲɔxɔ a ma a i tema han ariyanna kui? Ade, i ragoroma nɛ han yahannama, barima kaabanako naxee raba i tagi, xa nee sa raba Sodoma nɛ nu, a a lima na taa mu sɔntɔma nu. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Na nan a ra, n xa a fala wo bɛ, kiitisa lɔxɔɛ xɔrɔxɔma wo tan ma dangi Sodomakae ra.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fafe Isa ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luki 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Na tɛmui Isa naxa a fala, «Baba Ala, koore nun bɔxi Marigi, n bara i tantu i to yi fee nɔxunxi lɔnnilae nun xaxilimae ma, i e masen dimɛdie bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Iyo, n Baba, n bara i tantu barima i kɛnɛn fe nan ya.»<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />«N Baba bara fe birin taxu n na. Mixi yo mu Ala xa Di kolon, fo Baba Ala. Mixi yo mu Baba Ala kolon, fo Ala xa Di, a nun Di nu tin a masende naxan bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Wo fa n ma, wo tan naxee taganxi, kote binye naxee xun, n xa malabui fi wo ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Wo xa n ma karafoe nan nagoro wo kɔn ma, wo xa findi n ma taalibie ra, barima n bɔɲɛ bɛɛxi, a mu tema. Na kui, wo bɔɲɛ malabui sɔtɔma nɛ, <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />barima n karafoe naxan nagoroma wo kɔn, a mu xɔrɔxɔ, n kote naxan dɔxɔma wo xun, a mu binya.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Malabu lɔxɔɛ xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maraki 2:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:1-11">Luki 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Na waxati, malabu lɔxɔɛ ma, Isa nu ɲɛrɛfe xɛe tagi. Kaamɛ to nu a fɔxirabirɛe suxuxi, e naxa mɛngi tɔnsɔɛ ndee ba, e xa e don. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Farisɛnie to na to, e naxa wɔyɛn Isa bɛ, «A mato, i fɔxirabirɛe na malabu lɔxɔɛ sɛriyɛ matandife.» <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />A naxa e yaabi, «Wo mu nu a xaran Dawuda naxan naba kaamɛ to a suxu, a tan nun naxee nu na a fɔxɔ ra? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />A so nɛ Ala xa banxi kui, a taami don naxan fixi Ala ma, hali a to mu daxa a tan nun a fɔxirabirɛe xa na don, fo sɛrɛxɛdubɛe. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Wo man mu nu a xaran Tawureta Munsa kui, a sɛrɛxɛdubɛe walima malabu lɔxɔɛ hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, kɔnɔ e mu yunubi sɔtɔma na kui? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />N xa a fala wo bɛ, naxan na wo yire be, a tide gbo hɔrɔmɔbanxi bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Xa wo fahaamui sɔtɔxi sɛbɛli ma nu, naxan a masenxi, ‹Hinnɛ rafan n ma dangife sɛrɛxɛ ra,› wo mu tinxintɔɛe tɔɔɲɛgɛma nu. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Adama xa Di nan na malabu lɔxɔɛ marigi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Isa to keli mɛnni, a naxa so e xa salide kui. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />A naxa xɛmɛ nde li naa, naxan bɛlɛxɛ tuuxi a ma. E naxa Isa maxɔrin, «A daxa mixi xa furema rayalan malabu lɔxɔɛ?» E nu katafe nɛ e xa nɔ Isa kalamude. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Xa wo xa yɛxɛɛ nde sin yili kui malabu lɔxɔɛ ma, nde na wo ya ma naxan tondima a ratede? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Adama tide gbo dangi yɛxɛɛ ra pon! Na nan a ra, fe fanyi rabafe daxa malabu lɔxɔɛ ma.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Na kui, a naxa a fala bɛlɛxɛ tuuxi kanyi bɛ, «I bɛlɛxɛ itala.» A naxa a itala, a naxa yalan alɔ a bɛlɛxɛ boore. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Kɔnɔ Farisɛnie to mini, e naxa e malan, e xa sa kira fen Isa faxafe ma.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa, Ala xa walikɛ sugandixi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Isa to na kolon, a naxa keli naa. Mixi gbegbe naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra. A naxa furema birin nayalan, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />a naxa e ratɔn e naxa a xa fe fala mixie bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Na kui, Annabi Esayi xa masenyi naxa kamali, a to a masen,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«N ma walikɛ sugandixi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">n xanuntenyi naxan nafanxi n bɔɲɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">N nan n Xaxili ragoroma nɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">a fan tinxinyi masen sie bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />A mu sɔnxɔɛ ratema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">a mu gbelegbelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">mixi yo mu a xui itexi mɛma taa kui.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />A mu kale kɔnkɔrɔnxi girama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">a mu lanpui dɛxɛ xuri raxubenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">han a tinxinyi xunnakelima tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Si birin e xaxili tima nɛ a xili ra.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi matandife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maraki 3:20-27</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 7:16-17">7:16-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luki 11:14-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:44-45">6:44-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Mixi nde naxa fa xɛmɛ nde ra Isa xɔn ɲinnɛ nu bara naxan findi dɔnxui nun boboe ra. Isa naxa a rayalan, a ya naxa se to, a tuli naxa fe mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Ɲama birin naxa kaaba, e nu e bore maxɔrin, «Dawuda xa Di xa mu yi ra?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Farisɛnie to e xui mɛ, e naxa a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ ɲinnɛ kerima ɲinnɛ mangɛ Bɛlɛsɛbulu nan saabui ra.» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Isa to e xaxili ma fe kolon, a naxa a masen e bɛ, «Ɲamanɛ yo a yɛtɛ gere lantareya kui, na ɲamanɛ xun nakanama nɛ feo! Taa fan, xa na mu a ra denbaya, xa e e yɛtɛ gere lantareya kui, e mu xanma. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Xa Sentanɛ Sentanɛ keri, a na a yɛtɛ nan gerefe. A xa mangɛya fa xanma di? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Xa n tan ɲinnɛe kerima Bɛlɛsɛbulu nan saabui ra, wo tan xa mixie e kerima nde saabui ra? Na kui e tan nan yati wo makiitima. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Kɔnɔ xa n tan ɲinnɛe kerima Ala Xaxili nan saabui ra, na nan na ki Ala xa mangɛya niini yati nan bara wo li. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Mixi nɔma sode sɛnbɛma xa banxi kui, a a harige ba a yi ra, xa a mu a xiri sinden? Kɔnɔ xa mixi banxi kanyi xiri, a nɔma nɛ a harige birin muɲade.»<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />«Mixi naxan mu birama n fɔxɔ ra, a tixi n kanke nɛ. Naxan mu n malima mixi malande, a na mixie rayensenfe nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Na nan a toxi, n xa a fala wo bɛ, adamadie xa yunubie nun marasɔtɔɛe birin nɔma nɛ xafaride, kɔnɔ Ala Xaxili rasɔtɔfe tan mu xafarima mixi bɛ muku. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Mixi na Adama xa Di rasɔtɔ, na yunubi nɔma nɛ xafaride a kanyi bɛ. Kɔnɔ mixi na Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi rasɔtɔ, na yunubi mu nɔma xafaride na kanyi bɛ duniɲa, a mu nɔma xafaride aligiyama.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Xa sansi findi a fanyi nan na, a bogi fanyi nan naminima. Xa sansi findi a kobi nan na, a bogi kobi nan naminima. Sansi kolonma a bogi nan ma. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Wo tan bɔximase bɔnsɔɛ, wo mu nɔma wɔyɛn fanyi falade, barima wo bɔɲɛ kobi. Mixi bɔɲɛ rafexi naxan na, na nan minima a dɛ i. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Fe fanyi to ragataxi mixi fanyi bɔɲɛ kui, a fe fanyi nan naminima. Fe kobi to ragataxi mixi kobi bɔɲɛ kui, a fe kobi nan naminima. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />N xa a fala wo bɛ, kiitisa lɔxɔɛ, adamadie dɛntɛgɛ sama nɛ wɔyɛn kobi birin ma naxee mini e dɛ i. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />I wɔyɛnyi naxan falama duniɲɛigiri kui, na nan kiiti fanma i ra, na nan kiiti kanama i ra.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Yunusa xa tɔnxuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matiyu 16:1-4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maraki 8:11-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luki 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Na xanbi, sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛnie naxa wɔyɛnyi tongo, e a fala Isa bɛ, «Karamɔxɔ, muxu wama i xa kaabanako nde tofe, a xa findi tɔnxuma ra muxu bɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «To mixie kobi, e bara gbilen Ala fɔxɔ ra. E wama tɔnxuma makaabaxi tofe, kɔnɔ tɔnxuma yo mu fima e ma bafe Annabi Yunusa xa tɔnxuma ra. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Annabi Yunusa xi saxan, kɔɛ saxan nadangi yɛxɛ xungbe furi kui ki naxɛ, Adama xa Di fan xi saxan, kɔɛ saxan nadangima na ki nɛ bɔxi bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Kiiti lɔxɔɛ, Ninewekae tima nɛ e nun to mixie, e seedeɲɔxɔya ba wo xili ma, barima e tan tuubi nɛ Annabi Yunusa xa kawandi saabui ra, a fa li naxan na wo yire yi ki be, a tide gbo Annabi Yunusa bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Kiiti lɔxɔɛ, Seeba mangɛ ginɛ fan tima nɛ e nun to mixie, a seedeɲɔxɔya ba wo xili ma, barima a tan fa nɛ kelife yire makuye Sulemani xa lɔnni ramɛde, a fa li naxan na wo yire yi ki be, a tide gbo Sulemani bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲinnɛ gbilenfe a lingira fori</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luki 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Ɲinnɛ na gbilen mixi fɔxɔ ra, a sigama yire maxare nɛ lingira gbɛtɛ fende, kɔnɔ a mu a toma. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Na tɛmui a a falama a yɛtɛ bɛ, ‹N xa gbilen n ma banxi kui n kelixi dɛnnaxɛ.› A na gbilen mɛnni a a lima nɛ na banxi makɔxi, a raxunmaxi a fanyi ra, ɲinnɛ gbɛtɛ yo mu na. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Na tɛmui, a sigama nɛ a sa fa ɲinnɛ solofere gbɛtɛe ra naxee ɲaaxu a bɛ, e birin so na banxi kui, e sabati naa. Na kui, na mixi xa fe ɲaaxuma nɛ dangife a singe ra. Na nan mɔɔli rabama to mixi kobie bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nga nun a xunyae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maraki 3:31-35</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luki 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Beenun Isa xa gɛ wɔyɛnde ɲama bɛ, a nga nun a xunya xɛmɛmae naxa fa, e ti tande, e nun Isa xa dɛ masara. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Mixi nde naxa a fala a bɛ, «I nga nun i xunyae na tande, e wama wo xa dɛ masara.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa na kanyi yaabi, «Nde findixi nga ra? Nde findixi n xunyae ra?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Na tɛmui Isa naxa a bɛlɛxɛ ti a fɔxirabirɛe ma, a a masen, «A mato, n nga nun n xunyae nan ya. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Mixi yo naxan n Baba sago rabama naxan na ariyanna, na kanyi nan findixi n xunya xɛmɛma, n maaginɛ, nun n nga ra.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Xɛ rawali xa taali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-20">Maraki 4:1-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:4-15">Luki 8:4-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Isa naxa mini banxi, a sa dɔxɔ baa dɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Ɲama gbegbe to malan a yire, a naxa sa dɔxɔ kunkui kui, ɲama naxa lu baa dɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />A naxa fe wuyaxi masen e bɛ taalie ra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">A naxa a masen, «Wo wo tuli mati. Xɛ rawali nde nan mini sansi xɔri garansande. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />A to nu sansi xɔri garansanma, xɔri ndee naxa bira sankira xɔn, xɔnie naxa fa, e e don gbiki. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Xɔri ndee fan naxa bira gɛmɛ yire, bɛndɛ mu gbo dɛnnaxɛ. Nee naxa bula mafuren na, barima na bɛndɛ mu tilin. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Kɔnɔ soge to xɔnɔ, na sansie naxa ragan, e xara gben, barima sanke mu nu na e bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Sansi xɔri ndee fan naxa bira tunbe kunsie tagi. Tunbe kunsie naxa gbo, e sansie ixɛtɛn, e e kana. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Sansi xɔri ndee fan naxa bira bɛndɛ fanyi ma. Na xɔrie tan, e keren keren birin naxa sansi tɔnsɔɛ ramini, ndee naxa xɔri kɛmɛ ramini, ndee xɔri tongo senni, ndee xɔri tongo saxan. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Xa wo tuli fe mɛma, wo wo tuli mati yi masenyi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa e maso a ra, e a maxɔrin, «Munfe ra i wɔyɛnma ɲama bɛ taali ra?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Ala bara fahaamui fi wo ma wo xa a xa mangɛya niini gundo kolon, kɔnɔ na fahaamui mu fixi mixi gbɛtɛe tan ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Mixi fahaamuxi xa fahaamui xun masama, kɔnɔ mixi fahaamutare, hali a naxan maɲɔxun a gbe ra, na fama bade a yi ra. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Na nan a toxi n wɔyɛnma mixie bɛ taali wɔyɛnyi ra, barima e ya se toma, kɔnɔ e mu a igbɛma, e tuli fe mɛma, kɔnɔ e mu a fahaamuma. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Na kui, Annabi Esayi xa masenyi bara rakamali e xa fe ra, naxan a masenxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‹Wo fe mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kɔnɔ wo mu a fahaamuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Wo fe toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kɔnɔ wo mu a igbɛma.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Yi ɲama bɔɲɛ bara xɔrɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">E bara e tuli dɛsɛ, e bara e ya raxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">alako e ya naxa fa fe igbɛ, e tuli naxa fa fe mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">e bɔɲɛe naxa fa fe kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">e naxa fa e ya rafindi n ma n xa e rayalan.›»<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Kɔnɔ ɲɛlɛxinyi na wo tan bɛ, barima wo yae se igbɛma, wo tulie fe mɛma. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, namiɲɔnmɛ nun tinxintɔɛ gbegbe bara wa e xa fee to wo naxee tofe, kɔnɔ e mu e to. E bara wa e xa fee mɛ wo naxee mɛfe, kɔnɔ e mu e mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Wo wo tuli mati, wo xa fahaamui sɔtɔ xɛsa xa taali ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Mixi na Ala xa mangɛya niini xa masenyi mɛ, a mu a fahaamu, Sentanɛ fama nɛ na masenyi bade a bɔɲɛ ma. Na kanyi misaalixi sansi xɔri nan na naxan biraxi kira xɔn ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Sansi xɔri naxee bira gɛmɛ yire, nee misaalixi mixi nan na naxan Ala xa masenyi mɛma, a a suxu mafuren sɛɛwɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Kɔnɔ sanke to mu na a bɛ, a xa danxaniya mu buma. Tɔɔrɛ nun ɲaxankatɛ na a li Ala xa masenyi xa fe ra, a gbilenma Ala xa fe fɔxɔ ra keren na. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Sansi xɔri naxan bira tunbe kunsie tagi, na misaalixi mixi nan na naxan Ala xa masenyi mɛma, kɔnɔ yi duniɲa kɔntɔfili nun naafuli xɔli a suxu han a Ala xa masenyi bɛɲin. Na kui, Ala xa masenyi mu nɔma a bɔɲɛ masarade. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Sansi xɔri naxan bira bɛndɛ fanyi tan ma, na misaalixi mixi nan na naxan Ala xa masenyi mɛma, a a fahaamu, a a bɔɲɛ masara. Na sansi xɔri a bogi raminima nɛ, nde xɔri kɛmɛ ramini, nde tongo senni, nde tongo saxan.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲooge ɲaaxi xa taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Isa naxa taali gbɛtɛ masen e bɛ, «Ala xa mangɛya luxi nɛ alɔ xɛmɛ naxan a xa xɛ garansan sansi xɔri fanyi ra. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Kɔnɔ mixie nu xife tɛmui naxɛ, a yaxui naxa fa, a ɲooge ɲaaxi xɔri garansan sansi fanyi xɔri longori ra, a siga. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Sansie to bula, e te han e dendenyi bara mini fɔlɔ, walikɛe naxa ɲooge ɲaaxi fan to sansie longori ra. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />E naxa xɛ kanyi maxɔrin, ‹Marigi, i mu sansi xɔri fanyi xa garansan i xa xɛ ma? Na ɲooge ɲaaxi fa kelixi minden?› <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />A naxa e yaabi, ‹N yaxui nde nan na rabaxi.› Walikɛe naxa a maxɔrin, ‹I wama muxu xa sa a tala?› <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />A naxa a fala, ‹Ade, xa na mu a ra sansi fanyi fan talama nɛ ɲooge ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Wo xa a lu e birin xa mɔ han xɛ xaba lɔxɔɛ. Na tɛmui n a falama nɛ xɛ xabae bɛ, wo ɲooge ɲaaxi nan singe tala, wo a raxiri alako a xa gan. Kɔnɔ wo sansi fanyi tan xaba, wo a xɔri ragata n ma bili kui.›»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Konde xɔri nun lɛbini xa taalie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maraki 4:30-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:18-21">Luki 13:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Isa naxa taali gbɛtɛ masen e bɛ, «Ala xa mangɛya maniyaxi konde xɔri nan na, mixi naxan si a xa daaxa. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />A xɔri xurun sansi xɔri birin bɛ, kɔnɔ a na mɔ, a bili xungbo bɔxi sansi birin bɛ. A findima wuri bili nan na, xɔnie fama e tɛɛe sade naxan salonyie kɔn na.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Isa naxa taali gbɛtɛ masen e bɛ, «Ala xa mangɛya maniyaxi lɛbini nan na, ginɛ naxan sa farin busali tagi xun ma, na fa farin birin nate.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nun taali wɔyɛnyie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maraki 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Isa naxa na fe birin masen ɲama bɛ taalie ra. A ɲan mu nu masenyi yo tima e bɛ a mu a fala taali daaxi. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Na kui, namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi naxa kamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">«Taali wɔyɛnyie nan minima n dɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">N fee masenma nɛ naxee nu nɔxunxi kabi duniɲa daa tɛmui.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ɲooge ɲaaxi xa taali tagi rabafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Na tɛmui, Isa naxa keli ɲama xun ma, a so banxi. A fɔxirabirɛe naxa e makɔrɛ a ra, e a fala a bɛ, «Ɲooge ɲaaxi xa taali tagi raba muxu bɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />A naxa e yaabi, «Naxan sansi fanyi garansanma, na misaalixi Adama xa Di nan na. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Xɛ misaalixi duniɲa nan na. Sansi fanyi misaalixi mixie nan na, naxee na Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. Ɲooge ɲaaxi misaalixi Sentanɛ xa die nan na. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Yaxui naxan ɲooge xɔri garansan, a misaalixi Ibulisa nan na. Xɛ xabɛ misaalixi duniɲa raɲɔnyi nan na. Xɛ xabae misaalixi malekɛe nan na. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Na ɲooge ɲaaxi talama ki naxɛ, a woli tɛ i, duniɲa raɲɔnyi fan luma na ki nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Adama xa Di fama a xa malekɛe xɛɛde, e mixi ratantanyie nun mixi kobie ba mixi gbɛtɛe ya ma, naxee na Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />E e wolima nɛ tɛ mankanɛ xɔɔra, wa nun ɲin maxinyi na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Na tɛmui tinxintɔɛe tan yanbama nɛ alɔ soge e Baba xa mangɛya niini bun ma. Xa wo tuli fe mɛma, wo wo tuli mati yi masenyi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Harige xungbe xa taalie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />«Ala xa mangɛya man luxi nɛ alɔ naafuli xungbe naxan nu nɔxunxi xɛ ma. Mixi nde to mini a ma, a naxa gbilen a nɔxun na, a siga ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. A naxa a sɔtɔse birin mati a fa na xɛ sara.»<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Ala xa mangɛya man luxi nɛ alɔ yulɛ naxan diyaman tofanyi fenfe. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />A to diyaman hagigɛ keren to, a naxa sa a sɔtɔse birin mati, a fa na diyaman sara.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛlɛ xa taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Ala xa mangɛya man luxi nɛ alɔ yɛlɛ naxan bara sa baa ma, a yɛxɛ mɔɔli birin suxu. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Yɛlɛ to rafe, mixie naxa a mabɛndun baa dɛ ra. E naxa dɔxɔ, e yɛxɛe mayegeti, e a fanyie sa paanie kui, e a ɲaaxie wɔlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Duniɲa raɲɔnyi luma na ki nɛ. Malekɛe fama mixi kobie nun mixi tinxinxie mayegetide, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />e mixi kobie woli tɛ mankanɛ xɔɔra, wa nun ɲin maxinyie na dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lɔnni fori nun a nɛɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Isa naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo bara na birin fahaamu?» E naxa a yaabi, «Iyo.» <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />A naxa a masen e bɛ, «Na nan a toxi, sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔ naxan bara fahaamui sɔtɔ Ala xa mangɛya niini xa fe ma, a luxi alɔ banxi kanyi naxan se nɛɛnɛe nun se forie raminima a harige ya ma.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasarɛtikae tondife lade Isa ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maraki 6:1-6</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luki 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Isa to gɛ na taalie masende, a naxa siga, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />a sa so a xɔnyi, a mɔxi dɛnnaxɛ. A to na mixie xaran e xa salide kui, e dɛ naxa ixara. E naxa e bore maxɔrin, «Yi xɛmɛ yi lɔnni sɔtɔxi minden? A nɔxi yi kaabanako fee rabade di? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Kamudɛri xa di xa mu yi ki? A nga xa mu xili Mariyama? A xunyae xa mu findi Yaki, Yusufu, Yuda, nun Simɔn na? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />A xunya ginɛmae fan mu na won ya ma be? A fa yi birin sɔtɔxi minden?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Na kui, e naxa xɔnɔ a ma, e tondi lade a ra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Namiɲɔnmɛ binyaxi yire birin fo a xɔnyi, a ngaxakerenyie tagi.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />A mu kaabanako gbegbe raba naa e xa danxaniyatareɲa xa fe ra.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Yaya xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maraki 6:14-29</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luki 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Na waxati, Galile mangɛ Herode naxa Isa xa fe mɛ. A naxa a fala a xa mixie bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />«Yaya Xunxa nan kelixi faxɛ ma. Na nan a toxi nɔɛ na a yi a xa kaabanakoe raba.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />A na fala nɛ, barima a tan Herode nu bara yaamari fi Yaya xa suxu, yɔlɔnxɔnyi xa sa a ma, a xa sa geeli Herodiyasi xa fe ra, a taara Filipu xa ginɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Yaya nu a falama Herode bɛ, «A mu daxa i xa yi ginɛ tongo.» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Herode nu wama Yaya faxafe nɛ, kɔnɔ a nu gaaxuxi ɲama ya ra, barima e nu laxi a ra a namiɲɔnmɛ nan nu Yaya ra.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Na tɛmui, e to nu Herode bari ɲɛ xungbilenyi xulunyi tife, Herodiyasi xa di ginɛ naxa fare boron mixie bɛ. A naxa rafan Herode ma <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />han a naxa a kali a a na sese maxɔrin a ma, a a fima nɛ a ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Herodiyasi xa marasi ma, a xa di naxa a fala Herode bɛ, «Yaya Xunxa xunyi so n yi ra pileti ma.» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mangɛ naxa nimisa, kɔnɔ a xa marakali nun a xa xɔɲɛe xa fe ra, a naxa yaamari fi e xa Yaya xunyi so na ginɛdimɛdi yi ra. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />A naxa mixie xɛɛ geeli, e xa Yaya xunyi bolon a dɛ i. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />E naxa fa a xunyi ra pileti ma, e a so ginɛdimɛdi yi ra. Ginɛdimɛdi fan naxa a xanin a nga xɔn ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Yaya fɔxirabirɛe naxa sa a fure tongo, e sa a ragata, e naxa sa na dɛntɛgɛ sa Isa bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa donse fife xɛmɛ mixi wulu suuli ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maraki 6:30-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luki 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Isa to na fe mɛ, a naxa keli mɛnni kunkui kui, a siga a kerenyi ma wula i. Ɲama to a kolon, e fan naxa keli e xa taae, e siga a fɔxɔ ra e sanyi ra. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Isa to goro kunkui kui, a naxa ɲama gbegbe to naa. A naxa kinikini e ma, a e xa furemae rayalan.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nunmare to so fɔlɔ, Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa e maso a ra, e a fala a bɛ, «Won na wula nɛ yi ki, kɔɛ fan bara so. Ɲama rayensen alako e xa siga donse sara taae kui.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Hali e mu siga. Wo tan nan xa donse fi e ma.» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Kɔnɔ e naxa a fala a bɛ, «Taami gundi suuli nun yɛxɛ firin gbansan nan na muxu yi ra.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo fa nee ra n xɔn ma be.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Isa naxa ɲama yamari e xa e magoro na ɲooge xinde ma. A naxa na taami suuli nun na yɛxɛ firin tongo, a a ya rate koore ma, a fa Ala nuwali sa. A naxa taamie igira, a fa e so a fɔxirabirɛe yi ra, e xa e itaxun ɲama ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Ɲama birin naxa e dɛge han e wasa. Donse dɔnxɔɛ xuntunyie to matongo, debe fu nun firin nan nafe. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Mixi naxee e dɛge, xɛmɛ wulu suuli ɲɔndɔn nan nu e ra, bafe ginɛe nun dimɛe ra.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ɲɛrɛfe ye fari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maraki 6:45-52</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yaya 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Na xanbi Isa naxa a fala a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, a e xa baki kunkui kui, e xa siga a ya ra naakiri ma, a tan xa nu ɲama ragbilen. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Isa to gɛ ɲama ragbilende, a naxa te geya fari a kerenyi ma, alako a xa Ala maxandi. Kɔɛ naxa a li naa, a keren. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />A a lixi kunkui nu bara makuya xare ra, mɔrɔnyie nu na a mabɔnbɔfe ki fanyi ra barima foye ya nu rafindixi a ma.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Subaxɛ ma, Isa ɲɛrɛfe baa fari. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />A fɔxirabirɛe to a to ɲɛrɛ ra ye fari, e naxa gaaxu ki fanyi. E naxa gbelegbele, e a fala, «Tubari nan a ra!» <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa a masen e bɛ keren na, «Wo naxa kɔntɔfili, n tan nan a ra. Wo naxa gaaxu.» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Piyɛri naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, xa i tan nan a ra, yaamari fi n xa siga i yire ye fari.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Fa.» Piyɛri to goro kunkui kui, a naxa ɲɛrɛ ye fari sigafe ra Isa yire. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Kɔnɔ a to foye belebele mato, a naxa gaaxu, a madula fɔlɔ. A naxa gbelegbele, «N Marigi, n nakisi!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Isa naxa a bɛlɛxɛ itala keren na, a Piyɛri suxu. A naxa a masen a bɛ, «I xa danxaniya xurun. I siikɛxi munfe ra?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />E to baki kunkui kui, foye naxa raxara. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ naxee nu na kunkui kui, e naxa suyidi Isa bɛ, e a fala, «Ala xa Di yati nan lanxi i ma.»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Genesareti furema birin nayalanfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maraki 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />E to gɛ baa igiride, e naxa so Genesareti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Naakae to a kolon Isa nan a ra, e naxa na rabilinyi mixi birin nakolon. Mixie naxa fa furemae birin na Isa xɔn. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />E nu a mayandima furemae xa e bɛlɛxɛ din a xa donma sanbunyi gbansan na. Furema birin naxee na raba, e birin naxa yalan.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa sɛriyɛ nun adama xa naamunyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-23">Maraki 7:1-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Farisɛni nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔ ndee naxa fa Isa yire kelife Darisalamu. E naxa a maxɔrin, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Munfe ra i fɔxirabirɛe luma forie xa naamunyie matandi ra? E mu e bɛlɛxɛ raxama beenun e xa e dɛge alɔ forie xa naamunyie a masenxi ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Munfe ra wo tan Ala xa sɛriyɛ matandima wo xa naamunyie xa fe ra? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ala bara a masen, ‹Wo xa wo baba nun wo nga binya.› A man bara a masen, ‹Mixi yo naxan na a baba nun a nga konbi, a lan nɛ na kanyi xa faxa.› <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Kɔnɔ wo tan naxɛ, xa mixi nde a fala a baba xa na mu a nga bɛ, ‹I nu lanma i xa naxan sɔtɔ n na i malise ra, n bara a fi Ala ma,› <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />hali na kanyi mu fefe raba a baba bɛ. Na kui, wo Ala xa sɛriyɛ matandima wo xa naamunyi saabui ra. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Wo tan filankafuie! Annabi Esayi nɔndi yati nan masen wo xa fe ra,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‹Yi ɲama n binyama e dɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">kɔnɔ e bɔɲɛ makuya n na pon!<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />E xa sali fufafu nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">barima e mixi xaranma adamadie xa maɲɔxunyie nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">alɔ na maɲɔxunyie findixi n tan ma sɛriyɛ nan na.›»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Isa naxa ɲama xili, a a masen e bɛ, «Wo wo tuli mati, wo xa fahaamui sɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Se naxan soma mixi dɛ kui, na xa mu a findima mixi sɛniyɛntare ra. Naxan minima a dɛ kui, na nan a findima mixi sɛniyɛntare ra.»<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Na tɛmui Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa e maso a ra, e a fala a bɛ, «I mu a kolon i xa masenyi bara Farisɛnie raxɔnɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N Baba naxan na ariyanna, a sansi birin talama nɛ a tan mu naxan sixi. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Wo e lu na. Dɔnxui nan na e ra naxee dɔnxuie raɲɛrɛma. Xa dɔnxui dɔnxui raɲɛrɛ, e firin birin birama nɛ yili kui.»<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «Yi taali tagi raba muxu bɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Han ya wo fan mu fahaamui sɔtɔ? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Wo mu a kolon a se naxan birin soma mixi dɛ kui, a goroma furi nan kui, a fa mini fate i? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Kɔnɔ masenyi naxan minima mixi dɛ kui, a kelima a bɔɲɛ nan ma. Na nan nɔma a findide mixi sɛniyɛntare ra. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Barima maɲɔxun kobie, faxɛ tife, yɛnɛ, langoeɲa, muɲɛ, tɔɔɲɛgɛ, mixi xili kanafe, nee birin fatanma mixi bɔɲɛ nan na. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Nee nan mixi findima mixi sɛniyɛntare ra, kɔnɔ mixi a dɛgefe a bɛlɛxɛ raxatare ra, na xa mu a findima mixi sɛniyɛntare ra.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanaan ginɛ xa danxaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maraki 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Isa naxa keli mɛnni, a siga Tire nun Sidɔn bɔxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Kanaan ginɛ nde naxan kelixi na longori, a naxa fa Isa yire a a xui ite, «Marigi, Dawuda xa Di, kinikini n ma. Ɲinnɛ bara n ma di ginɛ ɲaxankata feo!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Kɔnɔ Isa mu sese fala a bɛ. A fɔxirabirɛe naxa e maso Isa ra, e a fala a bɛ, «Yi ginɛ keri, a na gbelegbelefe won fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Isa naxa a masen, «N xɛɛxi Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ gbansan nan ma, naxee luxi alɔ yɛxɛɛ lɔɛxie.» <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Kɔnɔ ginɛ naxa fa a suyidi a bɛ, a a fala, «Marigi, i xa n mali!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «A mu lan taami xa ba dimɛdie yi ra, a sa baree bun ma.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Ginɛ naxa a fala, «Marigi, i nɔndi, kɔnɔ hali baree, e donse xuntunyi nde sɔtɔma naxan birama e kanyi xa teebili ra.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Na kui, Isa naxa a masen a bɛ, «Ginɛ, i xa danxaniya gbo! I waxɔnfe bara raba i bɛ.» A xa di ginɛ naxa yalan keren na.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nɛmɛ fife xɛmɛ mixi wulu naani ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maraki 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Isa to keli mɛnni, a naxa ɲɛrɛ Galile baa dɛ ra han a naxa geya li. A naxa te geya fari, a dɔxɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Ɲama gbegbe naxa fa a yire naa, e fa namatɛe ra, a nun dɔnxuie, mabɛnyie, boboe, nun furema gbɛtɛe gbegbe ra. E naxa furemae sa Isa bun ma, a fan naxa e rayalan. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ɲama to a to boboe wɔyɛnma, mabɛnyie yalanma, namatɛe ɲɛrɛma, dɔnxuie se toma, e naxa kaaba. E naxa Isirayila Marigi Ala matɔxɔ.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Isa naxa a fɔxirabirɛe xili, a a masen e bɛ, «N bara kinikini yi ɲama ma, barima xi saxan nan yi ki, e na n yire be, kɔnɔ donse mu na e naxan donma. N mu wama e xa gbilen e xɔnyi kaamɛ ra e ma, xa na mu a ra e tɔɔrɔma nɛ kira xɔn ma.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa a maxɔrin, «Won donse sɔtɔma yi ɲama gbegbe bɛ minden? Won na wula nɛ yi ki.» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Taami gundi yeri na wo yi?» E naxa a fala, «Solofere, a nun yɛxɛ xunxuri ndee.»<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Isa naxa a fala ɲama bɛ e xa dɔxɔ bɔxi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />A naxa na taami gundi solofere nun na yɛxɛe tongo, a Ala nuwali sa. A to e igira, a naxa e so a fɔxirabirɛe yi ra, e xa e itaxun ɲama ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Ɲama birin naxa e dɛge han e wasa. Donse dɔnxɔɛ fan naxa matongo han debe solofere naxa rafe. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Xɛmɛ mixi wulu naani nan e dɛge, bafe ginɛe nun dimɛe ra.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Isa to gɛ ɲama ragbilende, a naxa baki kunkui kui, a siga Magadan bɔxi ma.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Farisɛnie nun Sadusenie xa danxaniyatareɲa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-21">Maraki 8:11-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Farisɛnie nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe naxa fa Isa yire. E to nu wama gantanyi safe a bɛ, e naxa a maxɔrin a xa tɔnxuma makaabaxi nde masen e bɛ kelife koore ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Nunmare na a li wo naxɛ, ‹Kuye fanma tina, barima koore igbeelixi.› <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Kuye nɛ iba wo naxɛ, ‹Tunɛ nun foye minima nɛ to, barima koore igbeelixi, nuxuie ifɔɔrɔ.› Wo fata koore ɲingi tagi rabade, kɔnɔ wo mu fata yi waxati fee tan tagi rabade. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />To mixie kobi, e bara gbilen Ala fɔxɔ ra. E wama tɔnxuma makaabaxi tofe, kɔnɔ tɔnxuma yo mu fima e ma bafe Annabi Yunusa xa tɔnxuma ra.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Na xanbi Isa naxa keli e xun ma, a siga.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa giri naakiri ma, e nɛɛmu taami ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo wo yɛtɛ ratanga Farisɛnie nun Sadusenie xa lɛbini ma.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa na fe mato, e fa a fala e bore bɛ, «A na falaxi nɛ barima won mu faxi taami ra.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Isa to nu e xa maɲɔxunyi kolon, a naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo taami fe falama wo bore bɛ munfe ra? Wo xa danxaniya xurun. <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Han ya wo mu xaxili sɔtɔ? Ka wo nɛɛmuxi nɛ taami gundi suuli to xɛmɛ wulu suuli wasa? Wo to na taami dɔnxɔɛ matongo, wo debee yeri rafe? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ka wo man nɛɛmuxi nɛ taami gundi solofere to xɛmɛ wulu naani wasa? Wo to na fan dɔnxɔɛ matongo, wo debee yeri rafe? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Munse a toxi wo mu a kolon a n mu taami fe xa falafe wo bɛ? Wo xa wo yɛtɛ ratanga Farisɛnie nun Sadusenie xa lɛbini ma.» <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Na kui, e naxa a fahaamu a Isa mu a falaxi xɛ e bɛ a e xa e yɛtɛ ratanga taami lɛbini daaxi ma. A nu a falafe nɛ e xa e yɛtɛ ratanga Farisɛnie nun Sadusenie xa xaranyi ma.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa findixi nde ra?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maraki 8:27-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luki 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Isa to Sesareya Filipi bɔxi li, a naxa a fɔxirabirɛe maxɔrin, «Mixie munse falama Adama xa Di xa fe ra? Nde lanxi a ma?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />E naxa a yaabi, «Ndee a falama Annabi Yaya Xunxa. Ndee a falama Annabi Eliya. Ndee a falama Annabi Yeremi, xa na mu a ra namiɲɔnmɛ gbɛtɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Isa naxa e maxɔrin, «Kɔnɔ wo tan naxɛ a di? Nde n na?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simon Piyɛri naxa a yaabi, «Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan na i ra, Abadan Ala xa Di.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Sɛɛwɛ na i bɛ, i tan Yunusa xa di Simɔn, barima ibunadama xa mu na masenxi i bɛ. N Baba naxan na ariyanna, na nan a masenxi i bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />N xa a fala i bɛ, i findixi Piyɛri nan na, naxan falaxi ‹gɛmɛ.› N nan n ma danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama tima na gɛmɛ nan fari. Hali faxɛ, a mu nɔma n ma ɲama ra. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />N Ala xa mangɛya saabi soma nɛ i yi ra. I na tɔnyi dɔxɔ fe naxan ma duniɲa, Ala naxan na ariyanna, a fan tɔnyi dɔxɔma nɛ na fe ra. I na tin fe naxan na duniɲa, Ala naxan na ariyanna, a fan tinma nɛ na fe ra.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Na tɛmui a naxa a matintin a fɔxirabirɛe ra, a e naxa a fala mixi yo bɛ, a a tan nan findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a xa faxɛ nun marakeli xa fe masenfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-33">Maraki 8:31-33</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luki 9:22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Keli na tɛmui ma, Isa naxa a tagi raba fɔlɔ a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, a fo a xa siga Darisalamu, a xa tɔɔrɛ gbegbe sɔtɔ Yuwifie xa forie, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie, nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe ra, e a faxa, kɔnɔ a man xa keli faxɛ ma a xi saxan nde ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Piyɛri to a bɛndun, e sa ti e xati ma, a naxa so wɔyɛnfe Isa ra, a a fala a bɛ, «Ala xa i tanga na ma, n Marigi! Na fe mɔɔli mu i sɔtɔma feo!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Isa naxa a ya rafindi Piyɛri ma, a a fala, «Keli n ya i, i tan Sentanɛ! I katafe nɛ i xa n natantan, barima i xaxili mu tixi Ala fee xa ra, a tixi adama fee nan na.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Birafe Isa fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Maraki 8:34-9:1</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luki 9:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Na tɛmui Isa naxa a masen a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «Xa mixi wa birafe n fɔxɔ ra, a xa a yɛtɛ waxɔnfe gere, a xa tondi a yɛtɛ ma, a tin tɔɔrɛ nun faxɛ ra, a bira n fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Mixi naxan wama a yɛtɛ rakisife, na kanyi lɔɛma nɛ. Naxan a yɛtɛ ralɔɛma n tan ma fe ra, na kanyi kisima nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Duniɲa birin sɔtɔɛ munse fanma mixi ma, xa a sigama yahannama? Fe mundun na, mixi nɔma a xa ariyanna masarade naxan na? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Adama xa Di fama fade a Baba xa nɔrɛ kui, e nun a xa malekɛe. Na tɛmui a mixi birin sare fima nɛ, kankan nun a kɛwali. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, mixi ndee tixi wo ya ma be, naxee mu faxama fo e Adama xa Di to fa ra a xa mangɛya kui.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Isa nɔrɔfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:1-13">Maraki 9:1-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luki 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Xi senni dangi xanbi, Isa naxa Piyɛri, Yaki, nun Yaki xunya Yaya xanin e doro ma geya itexi nde fari. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Mɛnni Isa naxa masara, a nɔrɔ e ya xɔri. A yatagi naxa yanba alɔ soge, a xa sosee naxa fiixɛ alɔ naiyalanyi. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Na tɛmui, Annabi Eliya nun Annabi Munsa naxa mini fɔxirabirɛe ya xɔri, e naxa e to e nun Isa wɔyɛnfe.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Piyɛri naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «Marigi, fe fanyi nan a ra muxu to na be yi ki. Xa i wa, n lingira saxan yailanma be, keren i gbe, keren Annabi Munsa gbe, keren Annabi Eliya gbe.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />A nu wɔyɛnfe tɛmui naxɛ, nuxui yanbaxi naxa goro e xun na, xui nde fan naxa mini nuxui kui, a a masen, «N ma Di maxanuxi nan yi ki naxan n kɛnɛnxi ki fanyi ra. Wo wo tuli mati a ra.» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Fɔxirabirɛe to na xui mɛ, e naxa gaaxu ki fanyi, e e yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa a maso e ra, a a bɛlɛxɛ sa e ma, a a fala, «Wo keli. Wo naxa gaaxu.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />E to e ya rakeli, e mu mixi yo to fo Isa.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />E to nu na gorofe geya fari, Isa naxa a matintin e ra, «Wo fe naxan toxi, wo naxa a fala mixi yo bɛ, han beemanun Adama xa Di xa keli faxɛ ma.» <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa a maxɔrin, «Munfe ra sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe a falama a fo Annabi Eliya nan singe xa fa?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />A naxa e yaabi, «Nɔndi nan a ra. Annabi Eliya nan singe fama yati, a fe birin yailan. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Kɔnɔ n xa a fala wo bɛ, Annabi Eliya ɲan bara fa, kɔnɔ e mu a kolonxi, e bara e waxɔnfe birin niya a ra. E man fafe Adama xa Di tɔɔrɔde na ki nɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Na kui, Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa a kolon a a nu na Yaya Xunxa nan ma fe falafe e bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲinnɛ kerife naxan nu dimɛdi fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-32">Maraki 9:14-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:37-45">Luki 9:37-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />E to ɲama yire li, xɛmɛ nde naxa fa Isa xɔn, a a xinbi sin a bun ma, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />a a fala, «Marigi, kinikini n ma di ma, xaxili fure a ɲaxankataxi ki fanyi. A luma bira ra tɛ xɔɔra, a nun ye xɔɔra. A na rabama han. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />N bara fa a ra i fɔxirabirɛe xɔn, kɔnɔ e mu nɔxi a rayalande.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo tan bɔnsɔɛ danxaniyatare, wo kobi! N xa lu wo sɛɛti ma han mun tɛmui? N xa ti wo bun ma han mun lɔxɔɛ? Wo fa na di ra n xɔn.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Isa naxa ɲinnɛ yamari, ɲinnɛ naxa gbilen dimɛdi fɔxɔ ra, dimɛdi naxa yalan keren na.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa e maso Isa ra, e a maxɔrin e doro ma, «Munfe ra muxu tan mu nɔ na ɲinnɛ keride?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo xa danxaniya nan xurun. N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, xa danxaniya na wo bɛ, hali a xurun alɔ konde xɔri, wo na a fala yi geya bɛ, ‹Keli be, i i masiga mɛnni,› a masigama nɛ. Fefe mu na wo mu nɔma naxan nabade. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Kɔnɔ yi ɲinnɛ mɔɔli tan mu kerima fo Ala maxandi nun sunyi saabui ra.»<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a xa faxɛ nun marakeli xa fe masenfe sanmaya firin nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maraki 9:30-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:43-46">Luki 9:43-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe to malan Galile, Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Adama xa Di sama nɛ mixie bɛlɛxɛ, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />e a faxa. A xa faxɛ xi saxan nde ma, a man kelima nɛ faxɛ ma.» A xa wɔyɛnyi naxa a fɔxirabirɛe nimisa ki fanyi.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nun Piyɛri hɔrɔmɔbanxi duuti fife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe to so Kapɛrɛnamu, hɔrɔmɔbanxi duuti maxilie naxa Piyɛri maxɔrin, «Pe, i karamɔxɔ mu hɔrɔmɔbanxi duuti fima?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Piyɛri naxa e yaabi, «Iyo, a a fima.» Piyɛri to so banxi, Isa nan singe wɔyɛn a bɛ, «Piyɛri, i a toxi di? Duniɲa mangɛe duuti maxilima nde ma, e xa die ka mixi gbɛtɛe?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Piyɛri naxa a yaabi, «Mixi gbɛtɛe.» Isa fan naxa a masen, «Na kui, mangɛ xa die tan mu duuti fima. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Kɔnɔ alako won naxa yi mixie raxɔnɔ, i xa siga baa dɛ ra, i kɔnyi woli. I na yɛxɛ naxan singe suxu, a rate, i a dɛ rabi. I kɔbiri kole toma nɛ a dɛ kui. I xa na so duuti maxilie yi ra, a xa findi won firin ma duuti ra.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mixi naxan tide gbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maraki 9:33-37</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luki 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Na tɛmui Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa e maso Isa ra, e a maxɔrin, «Nde binyaxi dangi birin na Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Isa naxa dimɛdi nde xili, a a ti e tagi, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />a a masen e bɛ, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, xa wo mu wo yɛtɛ magoro, wo lu alɔ dimɛdie, wo mu soma Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Na kui, mixi yo naxan a yɛtɛ magoroma alɔ dimɛdi, na nan findixi mixi xungbe ra dangi birin na Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Mixi yo naxan yi dimɛdi mɔɔli rasɛnɛma n xili ra, na kanyi bara n tan yɛtɛ yati rasɛnɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mixi ratantan saabui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maraki 9:42-48</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luki 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />«Mixi yo yi mixi xuri keren natantan, naxan danxaniyaxi n ma, a fisa na kanyi bɛ gɛmɛ binye xa xiri a kɔn ma, a rasin baa ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Gbaloe na duniɲa mixie bɛ e xa maratantanyi xa fe ra. A fɛɛrɛ mu na tan, fo maratantanyi xa mini, kɔnɔ gbaloe na mixi bɛ naxan findima na saabui ra. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Xa i bɛlɛxɛ, xa na mu i sanyi findi i ratantanse ra, a bolon, i a wɔlɛ. I sofe ariyanna i bɛlɛxɛ, xa na mu i sanyi bolonxi, na fisa i bɛ dinɛ i bɛlɛxɛ firin nun i sanyi firin luxi na, kɔnɔ i woli yahannama, tɛ mu xubenma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Xa i ya findi i ratantanse ra, a ba na, i a wɔlɛ. I sofe ariyanna i ya keren kanaxi, na fisa i bɛ dinɛ i ya firin lu na, kɔnɔ i woli yahannama.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛxɛɛ lɔɛxi xa taali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luki 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10-11" />«Wo naxa yo yi mixi xuri sese ma, barima n xa a fala wo bɛ, e xa malekɛe n Baba yatagi toma tɛmui birin, naxan na ariyanna.»<verse eid="MAT 18:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />«Wo a toxi di? Xa yɛxɛɛ kɛmɛ na mixi nde yi ra, keren fa lɔɛ e ya ma, a mu na yɛxɛɛ tongo solomanaani nun solomanaani luma xɛ geya fari, a siga na kerenyi fende? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, xa a sa a to, a ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ na yɛxɛɛ kerenyi xa fe ra, dangife yɛxɛɛ tongo solomanaani nun solomanaani boore ra, naxee mu lɔɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />A na na ki nɛ fan, wo Baba naxan na ariyanna, a mu tinma yi mixi xuri sese xa lɔɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haakɛ bafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Xa i ngaxakerenyi bara haakɛ sɔtɔ i ra, siga, wo firin xa sa lu yire keren, i xa a masen a bɛ a tantanxi ki naxɛ. Xa a sa i xui mɛ, i ngaxakerenyi bara ragbilen i ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Kɔnɔ xa a tondi i xui mɛde, i xa mixi keren xa na mu mixi firin fen, wo birin xa siga a yire alako kiiti xa sa seede firin, xa na mu seede saxan xui ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Xa a tondi nee fan xui mɛde, na fe masen danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama bɛ. Xa a tondi danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xui fan mɛde, a xa lu wo bɛ alɔ kaafiri, xa na mu a ra, duuti maxili. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, wo na naxan xiri duniɲa, a xirima nɛ koore fan ma. Wo na naxan fulun duniɲa, a fulunma nɛ koore fan ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />N man xa a fala wo bɛ, xa mixi firin lan fefe ma wo ya ma yi duniɲa ma, e Ala maxandi, n Baba naxan na ariyanna, a na fe rabama nɛ e bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Mixi firin, xa na mu a ra mixi saxan nu malan n xili ra dɛdɛ, n na e ya ma.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diɲɛfe ngaxakerenyi ma nun diɲɛtareɲa xa taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Na tɛmui, Piyɛri naxa a maso Isa ra, a a fala a bɛ, «N Marigi, n lanma n xa diɲɛ n ngaxakerenyi xa haakɛ ma sanmaya yeri? Han sanmaya solofere?» Isa naxa a yaabi, <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />«N xa a fala i bɛ, sanmaya solofere xa mu a ra de! I xa diɲɛ a ma sanmaya solofere dɔxɔ tongo solofere.»<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />«Ala xa mangɛya maniyaxi mangɛ nde nan na, naxan nu wama a xa kɔbiri fe ya ibafe a tan nun a xa walikɛe tagi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />A to a fɔlɔ, e naxa fa a xa walikɛ nde ra a xɔn, mangɛ xa doni nu naxan ma han gbeti kilo wulu kɛmɛ saxan, kilo wulu tongo naani. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Konyi to mu nu nɔma a xa doni fide, a xa mangɛ naxa yaamari fi, a tan yo, a xa ginɛ yo, a xa die yo, e nun a harige birin xa mati alako na doni xa fi. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Na walikɛ naxa a igoro bɔxi, a suyidi mangɛ bɛ, a a maxandi, ‹Yandi, diɲɛ n ma. N fama i xa doni birin fide.› <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Na kui, mangɛ naxa kinikini a xa walikɛ ma, a diɲɛ na doni birin ma, a a xa walikɛ rabɛɲin.»<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />«Kɔnɔ a tan walikɛ to mini, a naxa a boore walikɛ nde to a xa gbeti kilo tagi doni nu na naxan ma. A naxa bagan a ma, a a kɔnyi dekun, a sɔnxɔ a ra, ‹N ma doni fi!› <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />A boore naxa suyidi a bɛ, a a maxandi, ‹Yandi, diɲɛ n ma. N i xa doni fima.› <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Kɔnɔ a naxa tondi. A naxa a raso geeli kui, a xa lu mɛnni han a xa gɛ doni fide.»<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />«A boore walikɛe to na to, e naxa kinikini. E naxa na birin dɛntɛgɛ sa mangɛ bɛ naxan nu e birin xun ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Na kui, mangɛ naxa na walikɛ singe xili, a a fala a bɛ, ‹I tan walikɛ kobi! I to n mayandi, n tan diɲɛ nɛ i xa doni birin ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />A di, a mu lanma xɛ nu i fan xa kinikini i boore ma, alɔ n kinikinixi i tan ma ki naxɛ?› <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />A xa mangɛ to xɔnɔ a ma, a naxa a so kɔsibilie yi, e xa a sa geeli, e xa a ɲaxankata han a xa gɛ doni birin fide.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />«N Baba naxan na ariyanna, a na nan niyama wo fan na, xa wo mu diɲɛ wo ngaxakerenyi ma wo bɔɲɛ birin na.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Futi nun fatanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maraki 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Isa to gɛ yi fe birin masende, a naxa keli Galile bɔxi ma, a siga Yudaya bɔxi nde ma naxan nu na Yurudɛn naakiri ma. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Ɲama gbegbe naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra naa, a fan naxa furemae rayalan.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Farisɛnie naxa fa a yire alako e xa gantanyi te a bɛ. E naxa a maxɔrin, «A daxa xɛmɛ xa mɛɛ a xa ginɛ ra fe birin ma?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Kitaabui naxan masenxi wo mu nu a xaran? Fe fɔlɔ fɔlɛ ra, Daali Mangɛ naxa xɛmɛ nun ginɛ daa, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />a fa a masen, ‹Na kui, xɛmɛ kelima a baba nun a nga xun ma, a a xa ginɛ xa futi xiri, e firin findi keren na.› <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Na nan a toxi, mixi firin xa mu e ra sɔnɔn, e firin bara findi keren na. Ala bara naxee xiri e boore ra, adama naxa nee rafatan.»<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />E man naxa Isa maxɔrin, «Munfe ra fa Annabi Munsa a yamarixi, xɛmɛ naxan wama mɛɛfe a xa ginɛ ra, a lan a xa fatan kɛɛdi so a yi ra, a mɛɛ a ra?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo bɔɲɛe nan xɔrɔxɔ, na nan a niyaxi Annabi Munsa naxa fɛɛrɛ fi wo ma, wo xa nɔ mɛɛde wo xa ginɛe ra, kɔnɔ a mu nu na na ki xɛ a fɔlɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />N xa a fala wo bɛ, naxan yo mɛɛ a xa ginɛ ra, xa a xa ginɛ mu yɛnɛ xa rabaxi, a fa ginɛ gbɛtɛ dɔxɔ, na xɛmɛ bara yɛnɛ raba.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa a fala a bɛ, «Xa a na na ki nɛ xɛmɛ bɛ a xa ginɛ mabiri ra, hali a mu ginɛ dɔxɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Birin xa mu nɔma yi masenyi suxude, fo Ala a fɛɛrɛ fi naxan ma. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Wo a kolon, xɛmɛ ndee bari ki nan a niyaxi e mu nɔma ginɛ dɔxɔde. Ndee na na e e banaxi nɛ. Ndee fan na, e natɛ nan tongoxi e naxa ginɛ dɔxɔ Ala xa wali xa fe ra. Mixi naxan nɔma yi masenyi suxude, a xa a suxu.»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nun dimɛdi xunxurie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maraki 10:13-16</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luki 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Na tɛmui mixie naxa fa dimɛdie ra Isa xɔn, alako a xa a bɛlɛxɛ sa e ma, a duba e bɛ. Kɔnɔ a fɔxirabirɛe naxa wɔyɛn na mixie ma. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Na kui, Isa naxa a masen, «Wo a lu dimɛdie xa fa n yire. Wo naxa tɔnyi dɔxɔ e ma, barima naxee maniyaxi e ra, nee nan na Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />A naxa a bɛlɛxɛ sa e ma, a duba e bɛ. Na xanbi, a naxa siga.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛgɛtala bannaxi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maraki 10:17-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luki 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Sɛgɛtala nde naxa fa Isa xɔn, a a maxɔrin, «Karamɔxɔ, a lan n xa fe fanyi mundun naba alako n xa abadan kisi sɔtɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Isa fan naxa a maxɔrin, «I n maxɔrinma fe fanyi ma munfe ra? Ala keren peti nan fan. Xa i wama i xa kisi, Ala xa sɛriyɛ nan nabatu.» Xɛmɛ naxa a maxɔrin, «Ala xa sɛriyɛ mundue?» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «I naxa faxɛ ti. I naxa yɛnɛ raba. I naxa muɲɛ ti. I naxa mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />I baba nun i nga binya. I xa i ngaxakerenyi xanu alɔ i yɛtɛ yati.»<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Sɛgɛtala naxa Isa yaabi, «N bara na birin nabatu. Munse fa luxi?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Isa naxa a masen a bɛ, «Xa i wama i xa gɛ kamalide i xa kɛwalie kui, siga, sa i sɔtɔse birin mati, i a kɔbiri fi setaree ma. Na kui, i fama bannaya sɔtɔde ariyanna. I na na raba, fa, i bira n fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Sɛgɛtala to na mɛ, a naxa siga sunnunyi kui, barima harige gbegbe nu na a yi ra.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Isa naxa a masen a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, naafuli kanyi sofe Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma a xɔrɔxɔ. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />N man xa a fala wo bɛ, ɲɔxɔmɛ so ɲɔxun sɛnbɛ yale ra, dinɛ bannamixi sofe Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />E to na mɛ, Isa fɔxirabirɛe dɛ naxa ixara ki fanyi ra, e maxɔrinyi ti, «Nde, fa nɔma kiside?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Isa naxa e mato, a fa a masen, «Adama mu nɔma a yɛtɛ rakiside, kɔnɔ Ala tan nɔma fe birin na.»<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Na kui, Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «A mato, muxu bara keli se birin xun ma, muxu bira i fɔxɔ ra. Munse fa luma muxu bɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, duniɲa fe birin na masara a nɛɛnɛ ra, Adama xa Di naxa magoro a xa nɔrɛ kibanyi kui, wo tan n fɔxirabirɛe fan magoroma nɛ kibanyi fu nun firin kui, wo fa Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firin makiiti. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Mixi yo naxan na sa keli a xa se nde xun ma n tan ma fe ra, a findi banxie ra ba, xunyae ba, taarae ba, baba ba, nga ba, bɔxie ba, na kanyi nee ɲɔxɔ kɛmɛ kɛmɛ nan sɔtɔma, a man abadan kisi sɔtɔ kɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Yarerati wuyaxi fama findide xanbiratie ra, xanbirati fan findi yareratie ra.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Wali sare xa taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Ala xa mangɛya misaalixi xɛ kanyi nan na, naxan mini subaxɛ ma alako a xa walikɛe tongo a xa xɛ walife ra. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />E to lan a ma fɛɛɲɛn keren xa wali sare xa findi gbeti kɔbiri kole keren na, xɛ kanyi naxa walikɛe xɛɛ a xa xɛ yire. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />A man to mini gɛɛsɛgɛ, soge to nu bara mate, a naxa walikɛ gbɛtɛe li, e tixi taa kui, wali yo mu e yi. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, ‹Wo fan xa siga walide n ma xɛ ma. N wali sare tinxinxi fima nɛ wo ma.› <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />E fan naxa siga. Xɛ kanyi man naxa mini yanyi tagi, a walikɛ gbɛtɛe man tongo. Nunmare, a man naxa mixi gbɛtɛe sɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />A dɔnxɔɛ ra, lɛɛri ndee beenu kɔɛ xa so, a naxa mini, a walikɛ gbɛtɛe li, e tixi. A naxa e maxɔrin, ‹Fɛɛɲɛn, wo tixi be, wo mu walife. Munfe ra?› <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />E naxa a yaabi, ‹Mixi yo nan mu muxu tongoxi walide.› Xɛ kanyi naxa a fala e bɛ, ‹Wo fan xa siga walide n ma xɛ yire.›»<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />«Nunmare to so, xɛ kanyi naxa a fala a xa walikɛ xunyi bɛ, ‹Walikɛe xili, i xa e sare fi. A fɔlɔ dɔnxɔɛ rasoe ma, a raɲɔn a singe ma.› <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Naxee wali fɔlɔxi lɛɛri ndee beenu kɔɛ xa so, kankan naxa gbeti kɔbiri kole keren sɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Na kui, walikɛe naxee singe tongo, nee to fa e ɲɔxɔ a ma a e kɔbiri sɔtɔma dangi booree ra, kɔnɔ e fan naxa gbeti kɔbiri kole keren sɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />E to a rasuxu, e naxa wɔyɛn xɛ kanyi ma, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />e a fala, ‹Yi walikɛ dɔnxɔɛe, e waxati keren gbansan nan walixi, kɔnɔ i bara wali sare fi e ma naxan nun muxu gbe lan. Anun, muxu tan nan fɛɛɲɛnxi wali ra soge xɔnɛ bun!› <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />A naxa mixi keren yaabi e ya ma, ‹N boore, n mu fefe kobi niyaxi i ra. Won mu lan gbeti kɔbiri kole keren xa ma? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />I gbe tongo, i siga. N tan nan waxi a xɔn yi walikɛ dɔnxɔɛ xa wali sare xa lan i gbe ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />N mu nɔma n waxɔnfe rabade n ma kɔbiri ra? Ka i tɔɔnɛxi nɛ n to fe fanyi rabaxi mixi gbɛtɛ nde bɛ?› <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Na kui, xanbiratie fama findide yareratie ra, yareratie fan findi xanbiratie ra.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a xa faxɛ nun marakeli xa fe masenfe sanmaya saxan nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maraki 10:32-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luki 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Isa nun a xɛɛra fu nun firinyie to nu tefe Darisalamu, Isa naxa e xun lan, a fa a masen e doro bɛ kira xɔn ma, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Wo a mato, won na tefe Darisalamu nɛ yi ki. Adama xa Di sama nɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe bɛlɛxɛ, e a makiiti a xa faxa, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />e a so kaafirie yi ra. E a mayelema nɛ, e a bɔnbɔ sɛbɛrɛ ra, e fa a mabanban wuri magalanbuxi ma, kɔnɔ a xa faxɛ xi saxan nde ma, a man kelima nɛ faxɛ ma.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaki nun Yaya nga xa maxandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maraki 10:35-45</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:25-27">Luki 22:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Na tɛmui Sebede xa die nga naxa fa Isa yire, a nun a xa die. A naxa suyidi a bɛ, a xa a maxandi fe nde ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Isa naxa ginɛ maxɔrin, «I wama munse xɔn?» A naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «I xa tin, i na i xa mangɛya sɔtɔ, n ma yi di firinyie xa dɔxɔ i sɛɛti ma, keren i yirefanyi ma, boore i kɔɔla ma.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Isa naxa a masen di firinyie bɛ, «Wo mu a kolon wo fe naxan maxɔrinfe. N fafe tɔɔrɛ naxan tode, wo tinma na ra?» E naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, muxu tinma a ra.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo fan yati fama ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔde alɔ n tan, kɔnɔ dɔxɔfe n yirefanyi nun n kɔɔla ma, na mu fatanma n tan xa ra. Na na mixie nan bɛ, n Baba naxee sugandixi.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ fu dɔnxɔɛe to na fe mɛ, e naxa xɔnɔ na ngaxakerenyi firin ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa e xili a yire, a a masen e bɛ, «Ɲamanɛ mangɛe mixie yamarima a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, e e sɛnbɛ raminima mixie ma alako e xa mangɛya xa kolon. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Kɔnɔ a naxa lu na ki wo tan tagi. Mixi naxan wama a tide xa gbo wo ya ma, a xa findi wo xa konyi nan na. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Mixi naxan wama findife wo xa yarerati ra, a xa findi wo xa konyi nan na. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Wo xa lu nɛ alɔ Adama xa Di. A tan mu faxi xɛ mixie xa wali a tan bɛ. A faxi nɛ alako a tan nan xa wali mixie bɛ, a xa mixi gbegbe xunsara a xa faxɛ saabui ra.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dɔnxui firin nayalanfe Yeriko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maraki 10:46-52</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luki 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe to mini Yeriko, ɲama gbegbe naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Dɔnxui firin nu dɔxɔxi kira dɛ ra. E to a mɛ a Isa na dangife, e naxa e xui ramini, «Marigi, Dawuda xa Di, kinikini muxu ma!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Ɲama naxa wɔyɛn e ma, e xa e sabari, kɔnɔ e ɲan naxa e xui ite dangi a singe ra, «Marigi, Dawuda xa Di, kinikini muxu ma!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Isa naxa ti, a e xili, a e maxɔrin, «Wo wama n xa munse raba wo bɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />E naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, muxu wama muxu yae xa se to.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Isa naxa kinikini e ma, a a bɛlɛxɛ sa e yae ma. Keren na, e yae naxa se to, e naxa bira Isa fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Isa sofe Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maraki 11:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luki 19:28-40</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Yaya 12:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe to makɔrɛ Darisalamu ra, e naxa Betifage li, Oliwi geya mabiri. Isa naxa a fɔxirabirɛ firin xɛɛ, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />a a fala e bɛ, «Wo xa so taa kui naxan na yare. Wo nɛfɛ so naa, wo sofale ginɛ nde lima a xirixi naa, a xa di na a fɛ ma. Wo xa e fulun, wo fa e ra n xɔn ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Xa mixi nde fa wo maxɔrin, wo xa a fala a bɛ, ‹Marigi nan hayi na e ma. A e ragbilenma ya.›»<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Na rabaxi nɛ, alako namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi xa kamali, naxan a falama,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Wo a fala Siyoni di ginɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">‹A mato, i xa mangɛ na fafe i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">A fama yɛtɛ magore kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">a dɔxɔxi sofale nun a yɔrɛ fari.›»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa siga, e sa Isa xa xɛɛraya raba. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />E to fa sofale nun sofale xa di ra, e naxa e xa donmae sa e fari, Isa fa a magoro sofale fari. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Ɲama gbegbe naxan nu na, e fan naxa e xa donmae itala kira xɔn ma, ndee fan naxa fɛnsɛ sɛgɛ, e nee fan sa kira xɔn ma Isa binyafe ra. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Ɲama naxee nu ɲɛrɛfe Isa ya ra, a nun naxee nu ɲɛrɛfe a xanbi ra, e birin nu e xui itefe, e a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">«Tantui na won Nakisima bɛ, Dawuda xa Di!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Baraka na a bɛ naxan fafe Marigi xili ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Tantui na won Nakisima bɛ naxan na koore ma!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Isa to so Darisalamu, taakae birin naxa kaaba, e nu maxɔrinyi ti, «Nde yi ki?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Ɲama naxa e yaabi, «Annabi Isa nan yi ki, naxan kelixi Nasarɛti, Galile bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa sigafe hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maraki 11:15-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luki 19:45-48</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yaya 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Isa naxa so hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a sarematie nun saresoe birin keri naxee nu na na. A naxa kɔbiri masarɛe xa teebilie a nun ganbɛ matie xa dɔxɔsee rabira, <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />a a masen e bɛ, «A sɛbɛxi, ‹N ma banxi xili falama nɛ, salide banxi,› kɔnɔ wo tan bara a findi muɲɛtie dɔxɔde ra.»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Dɔnxuie nun namatɛe naxa fa Isa xɔn hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a naxa nee rayalan. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Kɔnɔ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe tan naxa xɔnɔ ki fanyi e to Isa xa kaabanakoe to, e man to dimɛe to e xui itema hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, «Tantui na won Nakisima bɛ, Dawuda xa Di!» <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />E naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «I mu e xui mɛxi?» Isa naxa e yaabi, «Iyo. Wo fan mu nu a xaran Kitaabui kui a to sɛbɛxi, ‹I bara a niya dimɛdie nun diyɔrɛe xa i matɔxɔ?›» <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Na tɛmui, Isa naxa keli e xun taa kui, a siga Betani, a kɔɛ radangi naa.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xɔrɛ bili dankafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maraki 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-25">20-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Na kuye iba, Isa to nu gbilenfe taa kui, kaamɛ naxa a suxu. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />A to xɔrɛ bili nde to kira ra, a naxa a maso a ra kɔnɔ a mu bogi yo to a kɔn na, fo a burɛxɛe. Isa naxa a fala xɔrɛ bili bɛ, «I tan mu bogima sɔnɔn!» Xɔrɛ bili naxa xara keren na. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe to na to, e naxa kaaba, e a maxɔrin, «Yi xɔrɛ bili xaraxi a ikɔrɛxi ra di?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, xa danxaniya na wo bɛ, wo mu siikɛ, wo nɔma nɛ yi fe mɔɔli nabade n naxan nabaxi xɔrɛ bili ra. Kɔnɔ dangi na ra, xa wo a fala yi geya bɛ, ‹Keli be, i sa sin baa ma,› a rabama nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Na nan a ra, xa danxaniya na wo bɛ, wo fefe maxandi Ala ma, wo a sɔtɔma nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa walima nde xa yaamari ma?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maraki 11:27-33</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luki 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Isa man naxa so hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. A to nu na mixie xaranfe, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie, nun Yuwifie xa forie naxa fa a yire, e a maxɔrin, «I yi fee rabama nde xa yaamari ma? Nde yi sɛnbɛ fixi i ma?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N fan xa wo maxɔrin fe keren ma. Xa wo n yaabi, n a falama nɛ wo bɛ n yi fee rabama naxan ma yaamari ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Yaya nu mixie xunxama ye xɔɔra nde xa yaamari ma? Ala nan a xɛɛxi ba, ka adama?» Na kui, e naxa so wɔyɛnfe e bore tagi, «Xa won na a yaabi, won naxɛ, ‹Ala,› a a falama nɛ won bɛ, ‹Munfe ra wo mu fa la a ra?› <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Kɔnɔ xa won na a yaabi, won naxɛ, ‹Adama,› won gaaxuma nɛ ɲama ya ra, barima birin Yaya maɲɔxunxi namiɲɔnmɛ nan na.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Na kui, e naxa Isa yaabi, «Muxu mu a kolon.» A fan naxa a masen e bɛ, «N fan mu a falama wo bɛ n yi fee rabama naxan ma yaamari ma.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Di xɛmɛ firinyie xa taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />«Wo yi taali toxi di? Di xɛmɛ firin nu na xɛmɛ nde yi. A naxa a fala di singe bɛ, ‹N ma di, siga i sa wali xɛ ma to.› <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Di naxa a yaabi, ‹N tondi.› Kɔnɔ na dangi xanbi, a xaxili naxa masara, a siga walide. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Babɛ to na yaamari fi a xa di firin nde fan ma, a naxa a yaabi, ‹N Baba, awa, n sigafe.› Kɔnɔ a mu siga. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Yi mixi firinyie ya ma, nde a baba sago rabaxi?» E naxa a yaabi, «Na di singe.» Isa man naxa a masen e bɛ, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, duuti maxilie nun langoee singe soma wo bɛ Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Annabi Yaya fa nɛ kira tinxinxi masende wo bɛ, wo mu fa la a ra. Kɔnɔ duuti maxilie nun langoee tan la nɛ a ra. Hali wo to na to, wo mu tin natɛ masarade, wo xa la a ra.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔxi rawali kobie xa taali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maraki 12:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luki 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Wo wo tuli mati taali gbɛtɛ fan na. Xɛ kanyi nde naxa wɛni bilie si. A naxa tɛtɛ rabilin bɔxi ra, a baye ti, a yili ge wɛni bogi bunduma dɛnnaxɛ. Na xanbi, a naxa na hɛri bɔxi rawalie ma, a fa biyaasi. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Wɛni bogi ba tɛmui to a li, bɔxi kanyi naxa konyi ndee xɛɛ bɔxi rawalie xɔn ma, e xa a gbe wɛni bogi so a yi ra. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Kɔnɔ bɔxi rawalie naxa na konyie suxu. E naxa keren bɔnbɔ, e boore faxa, e boore magɔnɔ gɛmɛe ra. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Bɔxi kanyi man naxa konyi gbɛtɛe xɛɛ dangi a singe ra. Bɔxi rawalie naxan naba booree ra, e naxa na raba nee fan na. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />A dɔnxɔɛ ra, bɔxi kanyi naxa a maɲɔxun, a a fala, ‹E n ma di tan binyama nɛ.› Na kui, a naxa a xa di xɛɛ bɔxi rawalie xɔn ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Kɔnɔ e to bɔxi kanyi xa di to, e naxa a fala e bore bɛ, ‹Yi nan na kɛ tongoma ra. Wo fa, won xa a faxa alako a kɛ xa findi won gbe ra.› <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />E to a suxu, e naxa sa a xanin tɛtɛ xanbi ra, e a faxa.»<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />«Na kui, bɔxi kanyi na siga e yire, a munse rabama na bɔxi rawalie ra?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />E naxa Isa yaabi, «A na bɔxi hɛrie sɔntɔma nɛ a ɲaaxi ra, a a xa bɔxi so bɔxi hɛri gbɛtɛe yi, naxee a mabiri soma a yi ra a waxati ma.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo mu nu yi masenyi xaran Kitaabui kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‹Banxitie mɛɛ gɛmɛ naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">a bara findi tuxui gɛmɛ hagigɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Marigi fɔxi nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Fe makaabaxi nan ya won bɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />«Na nan a toxi, n xa a fala wo bɛ, wo bama nɛ Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma, si gbɛtɛ fa raso naa naxan birama Ala xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Naxan na bira yi gɛmɛ ma, a kanyi magirama nɛ gbɛsɛxu. Yi gɛmɛ na bira naxan fan ma, a kanyi butuxunma nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Farisɛnie to a xa taalie mɛ, e naxa a kolon a Isa nu na wɔyɛnfe e tan nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />E nu katafe e xa a suxu, kɔnɔ e nu gaaxuxi ɲama ya ra, barima ɲama nu laxi a ra, a namiɲɔnmɛ nan na Isa ra.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Futixiri xulunyi xa taali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luki 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Isa man naxa so wɔyɛnfe e bɛ taalie ra. A naxa a masen, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Ala xa mangɛya misaalixi mangɛ nan na, naxan xulunyi ti a xa di xa futi xirife ma, donse fanyi gbegbe donma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />A naxa a xa konyie xɛɛ e xa mixie xili, yi fe binyɛ nu bara ragbilen naxee ma, kɔnɔ na mixie mu tin fade. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Mangɛ man naxa konyi gbɛtɛe xɛɛ, e xa a fala na mixi maxilixie bɛ, ‹Wo ya ti, donse bara gɛ rafalade, n bara n ma ninge bɔrɔgɛxie faxa, fe birin bara gɛ yailande. Wo fa n ma di xa futixiri xulunyi.› <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Kɔnɔ e mu xɛɛrae danxun. Ndee naxa siga e xa xɛ yire, ndee fan naxa siga e xa yulɛya rabade. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Naxee lu, e naxa mangɛ xa konyie suxu, e e ɲaxankata, e e faxa.»<verse eid="MAT 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />«Mangɛ naxa xɔnɔ, a a xa sɔɔrie xɛɛ, a e xa na faxatie birin faxa, e e xa taa gan. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Na dangi xanbi, a naxa a fala a xa konyie bɛ, ‹N ma di xa futixiri xulunyi xa fe birin bara gɛ yailande. Donsee birin nafalaxi, kɔnɔ mixi naxee nu maxilixi, a mu daxa e xa na binyɛ sɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Na kui, wo xa siga taa kui, wo sa mixie xili wo naxee yo toma naa, e xa fa n ma di xa futixiri xulunyi.› <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Konyie naxa mini kirae ma, e naxa mixi birin xili e xa fa. Mixi fanyi yo, mixi kobi yo, e birin naxa fa futixiri xulunyi, mangɛ xɔnyi naxa rafe ɲama ra.»<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />«Mangɛ to so na mixi maxilixie ya ma, a naxa xɛmɛ nde to xulunyi donma mu nu ragoroxi naxan ma. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹N ma di, i soxi be di, i to mu maxirixi a xulunyi ki ma?› Kɔnɔ xɛmɛ mu nɔ yaabi yo fide. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Na kui, mangɛ naxa a fala a xa walikɛe bɛ, ‹Wo a sanyie nun a bɛlɛxɛe xiri, wo a woli tande dimi kui, wa nun ɲin maxinyi na dɛnnaxɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Mixi gbegbe maxilixi, kɔnɔ naxee sugandixi, e xurun.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gantanyi tefe Isa bɛ duuti xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maraki 12:13-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luki 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Na tɛmui, Farisɛnie naxa sa e malan, e natɛ tongo e gantanyi tema Isa bɛ ki naxɛ, e xa a masɔtɔ wɔyɛnyi kui. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />E naxa e fɔxirabirɛe nun Herode xa mixi ndee xɛɛ Isa xɔn. Nee naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «Karamɔxɔ, muxu a kolon nɔndi falɛ nan i ra. I mixie xaranma Ala xa kira ra a nɔndi ki ma. I mu gaaxuma mixi yo xɔn, barima i mu mixi rafisama e booree bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Na kui, a fala muxu bɛ, i a toxi di? A lanma ka a mu lanma muxu xa duuti fi Rɔma mangɛ ma?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Isa to nu e xaxili kobi kolon, a naxa e yaabi, «Wo tan filankafuie, wo katafe n masɔtɔde munfe ra? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Wo kɔbiri kole masen n bɛ duuti fima naxan na.» E naxa gbeti kole ramini a bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Isa naxa e maxɔrin, «Nde xili nun nde misaali na yi kɔbiri kole ma yi ki?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />E naxa a yaabi, «Rɔma Mangɛ.» A fan naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo mangɛ gbe ragbilen mangɛ ma, wo Ala fan gbe ragbilen Ala ma.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />E to a xa yaabi mɛ, e naxa kaaba. E naxa keli a xun, e siga.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadusenie Isa maxɔrinfe faxamixie xa marakeli ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maraki 12:18-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luki 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Na lɔxɔɛ kerenyi, Sadusenie naxa fa Isa xɔn. E tan nan a falama a faxamixie mu kelima faxɛ ma. E naxa Isa maxɔrin, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />«Karamɔxɔ, Annabi Munsa a masen nɛ, ‹Xa xɛmɛ nde taara faxa, a naxa a xa ginɛ lu a mu di yo bari, a na xunya nan na ginɛ dɔxɔma, alako a xa bɔnsɔɛ fi a taara ma.› <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Na kui, xɛmɛ nde naxa di xɛmɛ solofere sɔtɔ muxu ya ma be. A xa di singe naxa ginɛ dɔxɔ, a faxa, a mu bɔnsɔɛ yo lu. A xanbiratoe naxa a xa kaaɲɛ ginɛ tongo, <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />kɔnɔ na fan naxa faxa, a mu bɔnsɔɛ yo lu. Na nan man naba na fan xanbiratoe ra, a nun na mixi naani dɔnxɔɛ birin. E birin naxa faxa, e sese mu bɔnsɔɛ lu. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />A dɔnxɔɛ ra, ginɛ fan naxa faxa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Na kui, marakeli lɔxɔɛ, na ginɛ to dɔxɔxi yi mixi solofere birin xɔn ma, a findima nde gbe ra?»<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo na tantanyi kui, barima wo mu Kitaabui kolon, wo mu Ala sɛnbɛ fan kolon. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Mixie na keli faxɛ ma marakeli lɔxɔɛ, xɛmɛ mu ginɛ dɔxɔma, ginɛ fan mu dɔxɔma xɛmɛ xɔn. E luma nɛ alɔ malekɛe na ariyanna ki naxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />A falafe tan, a faxamixie mu kelima faxɛ ma, Ala naxan masen wo bɛ, wo mu nu a xaran? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />A a masen nɛ, ‹N tan nan na Marigi Alatala ra, Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba naxan batuma.› Faxamixie xa mu Ala batuma, fo mixi ɲiɲɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Ɲama to Isa xa yaabi mɛ, e naxa kaaba a xa fasari ma.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaamari naxan tide gbo a birin bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maraki 12:28-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:25-37">Luki 10:25-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Farisɛnie to a mɛ a Isa nu bara Sadusenie dɛ balan yaabi fanyi ra, e naxa e malan. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Ala xa sɛriyɛ lɔnnila nde nu na e ya ma. Na naxa kata Isa masɔtɔde maxɔrinyi ra, a naxɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Karamɔxɔ, yaamari mundun tide gbo a birin bɛ Tawureta Munsa kui?» <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «‹I xa i Marigi Ala xanu i bɔɲɛ birin na, i nii birin na, a nun i xaxili birin na.› <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Na nan tide gbo, a findi yaamari singe nan na Ala xa sɛriyɛ birin ya ma. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />A firin nde maniya na singe ra, ‹I xa i ngaxakerenyi xanu alɔ i i yɛtɛ xanuxi ki naxɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Tawureta Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa sɛriyɛ birin gbakuxi yi yaamari firin nan na.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda nun Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maraki 12:35-37</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luki 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Farisɛnie to nu malanxi naa, Isa naxa e fan maxɔrin, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Wo Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa fe toxi di? Nde xa di a ra?» E naxa a yaabi, «Dawuda nan xa di a ra.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Isa fa e maxɔrin, «Munfe ra fa, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra, Dawuda yɛtɛ naxa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xili ‹N Marigi›? A tan Dawuda naxa a masen,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‹Marigi bara a masen n Marigi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">“I magoro n yirefanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">han beemanun n xa i yaxuie ragoro i sanyi bun.”›»<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />«Xa Dawuda yɛtɛ yati naxɛ a bɛ ‹N Marigi›, a tan Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nɔma findide Dawuda xa di ra di?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Mixi yo mu nɔ yaabi yo fide. Fɔlɔ na lɔxɔɛ ma, mixi yo mu suusa maxɔrinyi tide Isa ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Diinɛla kobie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maraki 12:38-40</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:38-52">Luki 11:38-52</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Isa naxa a masen ɲama nun a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Sɛbɛlitie nun Farisɛnie mixie xaranma Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ nan na. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Na kui, wo xa nu e xui rabatu, wo ɲɛrɛ a ma. Kɔnɔ wo naxa e wali fɔxi tan naba de, barima e naxan falama, e mu na xa rabama. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />E kote binyee raxirima, e e sa mixie fari, kɔnɔ e tan mu tinma e malide hali e bɛlɛxɛsole keren na. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />E e xa kɛwalie birin nabama alako mixie xa e to. E e xa sɛbɛe rabelebelema e naxee xirima e tigi nun e bɛlɛxɛ ra. Luuti dɛnbɛxie naxee singanma donma sanbunyi ra Ala xa fe ma, e nee rakuyama han a dangi a i. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />E na siga e dɛgede mixi xɔnyi malanyi na dɛnnaxɛ, xa na mu e na so salide banxi, binyɛ dɔxɔde rafan e ma ki fanyi. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />E na siga taa kui, a rafan e ma mixie xa e xɛɛbu binyɛ ra, e na a fala e bɛ, ‹Karamɔxɔ.›»<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />«Kɔnɔ mixie naxa a fala wo tan bɛ ‹Karamɔxɔ,› barima karamɔxɔ keren peti nan na wo bɛ, wo fan birin findixi ngaxakerenmae nan na. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Wo naxa yi duniɲa adamadi xili ‹N Baba,› barima Babɛ keren peti nan na wo bɛ, wo Baba naxan na ariyanna. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Mixie man naxa a fala wo tan bɛ ‹Mangɛ,› barima Mangɛ keren peti nan na wo bɛ, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Naxan na mixi xungbe ra wo ya ma, a xa findi wo xa walikɛ nan na. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Naxan na a yɛtɛ igbo, a xa fe fama nɛ igorode. Naxan a yɛtɛ magoroma, a xa fe fama nɛ itede.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13-14" />«Kɔnɔ gbaloe na wo bɛ, wo tan sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛni filankafuie, barima wo naadɛ balanma mixie ya ra alako e naxa so Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. Na kui, wo tan yɛtɛ mu soma, wo man mu tinma mixi gbɛtɛe fan xa so naa naxee waxi sofe.»<verse eid="MAT 23:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />«Gbaloe na wo bɛ, wo tan sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛni filankafuie! Wo baa igirima, wo bɔxi birin isa alako wo xa mixi keren naso wo xa dinɛ, kɔnɔ a na so, wo a findima yahannama di nan na, naxan kobi dɔxɔ firin wo tan na.»<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />«Gbaloe na wo bɛ, wo tan yarerati dɔnxuie! Wo a falama, ‹Xa mixi a kali hɔrɔmɔbanxi ra, fefe mu a ra, hali a kanyi mu a xui rakamali. Kɔnɔ xa mixi a kali xɛɛma ra naxan na hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, fo a kanyi xa a xui rakamali teku.› <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Wo tan dɔnxui xaxilitaree! Mundun tide gbo, xɛɛma, ka hɔrɔmɔbanxi naxan xɛɛma findixi se sɛniyɛnxi ra? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Wo man a falama, ‹Xa mixi nde a kali sɛrɛxɛbade ra, fefe mu a ra hali a kanyi mu a xui rakamali. Kɔnɔ xa mixi a kali sɛrɛxɛ ra naxan na sɛrɛxɛbade fari, fo a kanyi xa a xui rakamali teku.› <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Wo tan dɔnxuie! Mundun tide gbo, sɛrɛxɛ, ka sɛrɛxɛbade naxan sɛrɛxɛ findixi se sɛniyɛnxi ra? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Na kui, naxan yo na a kali sɛrɛxɛbade ra, a bara a kali na ra, a nun sɛrɛxɛ fan naxan birin saxi a fari. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Naxan yo na a kali hɔrɔmɔbanxi ra, a bara a kali na ra, a nun naxan fan sabatixi a kui. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Naxan yo na a kali ariyanna ra, a bara a kali Ala xa kibanyi ra, a nun naxan fan magoroxi a kui.»<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />«Gbaloe na wo bɛ, wo tan sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛni filankafuie! Wo sansi xunxurie farilɛ bama, alɔ salaxui, suloɲi, nun digiyanyi, kɔnɔ fe naxee findixi a hagigɛe ra Ala xa sɛriyɛ kui, alɔ tinxinyi, kinikini, nun danxaniya, wo gbilenxi nee nan fɔxɔ ra. A lanma nɛ nu wo xa na sɛriyɛ hagigɛe rabatu, wo man mu nɛɛmu na sɛriyɛ xunxurie dɔnxɔɛe ma. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Yarerati dɔnxuie! Wo minse rasɛnsɛnma kuli di xa fe ra, wo fa ɲɔxɔmɛ gundi gerun!»<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />«Gbaloe na wo bɛ, wo tan sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛnie filankafuie! Wo pɔɔti nun pileti fari maxama, kɔnɔ e kui rafexi balose naxan na, wo a sɔtɔxi muɲɛ nun wasatareya nan saabui ra. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />I tan farisɛni dɔnxui! Pɔɔti nun pileti kui rasɛniyɛn sinden, na tɛmui a fari fan sɛniyɛnma nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />«Gbaloe na wo bɛ, wo tan sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛni filankafuie! Wo maniyaxi gaburie nan na, naxee fari ratofanxi, kɔnɔ e kui rafexi faxamixi xɔrie nun sɛniyɛntareɲa mɔɔli birin na. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Wo fan, mixi na wo to, e wo maɲɔxunma tinxintɔɛe nan na, kɔnɔ wo bɔɲɛ kui rafexi filankafuiɲa nun kobiɲa ra.»<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />«Gbaloe na wo bɛ, wo tan sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛni filankafuie! Wo gaburi fanyie yailanma namiɲɔnmɛe bɛ, wo tinxintɔɛe xa gaburie raxunmama, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />wo a fala, ‹Xa muxu nu na duniɲa ma muxu benbae waxati, muxu mu kafuma e ma nu namiɲɔnmɛe faxafe ra.› <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Na kui, wo bara seedeɲɔxɔya ba wo yɛtɛ xili ma, a falafe ra a wo findixi namiɲɔnmɛ faxɛe xa die nan na. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Wo wo benbae xa kɛwalie rakamali yire! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Wo tan bɔximase bɔnsɔɛ, wo ratangama yahannama ma di?»<verse eid="MAT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />«Na kui, n xa a fala wo bɛ, n fafe namiɲɔnmɛe, lɔnnilae, nun karamɔxɔe xɛɛde wo yire, kɔnɔ wo ndee faxama nɛ, wo ɲan nee ndee mabanbanma nɛ wuri magalanbuxie ma. Wo ndee bɔnbɔma nɛ sɛbɛrɛ ra wo xa salidee kui, e man siga taa yo kui, wo birama e fɔxɔ ra e ɲaxankatafe ra. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Na nan a ra, tinxintɔɛe xa wuli naxan ifilixi duniɲɛ, a birin luma wo tan nan ma, kelife Habila ma dɔxɔ Berekiya xa di Sakari ra, wo naxan faxa hɔrɔmɔbanxi nun sɛrɛxɛbade tagi. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, yi ɲaxankatɛ birin fama nɛ to mixie sɔtɔde.»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa sunnunfe Darisalamu xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luki 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />«Darisalamu, Darisalamu, taa naxan namiɲɔnmɛe faxama, naxan Ala xa xɛɛrae magɔnɔma. Sanmaya wuyaxi n bara wa i xa die malanfe n yire, alɔ tɔxɔɛ a xa die rasoma a gabutenyi bun ma ki naxɛ, kɔnɔ wo naxa tondi! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Na kui, Ala bara keli wo xa banxi xun ma. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />N xa a fala wo bɛ, wo mu n toma sɔnɔn, han wo a falama tɛmui naxɛ, ‹Baraka na mixi bɛ naxan fafe Marigi xili ra!›»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa kanɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maraki 13:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luki 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Isa naxa mini hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. A nu sigafe tɛmui naxɛ, a fɔxirabirɛe naxa e maso a ra, e wɔyɛn a bɛ a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi mato a nun banxie naxee na a rabilinyi, e ti ki to tofanxi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo yi birin toxi? N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, yi gɛmɛ keren mu fama lude a boore fari be, a birin nabirama nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duniɲa raɲɔnyi tɔnxumae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-23">Maraki 13:3-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:7-24">Luki 21:7-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Isa nu magoroxi Oliwi geya fari tɛmui naxɛ, a fɔxirabirɛe naxa siga a yire, e a maxɔrin e doro ma, «Na fe sa rabama mun tɛmui? A man sa kolonma tɔnxuma mundun ma a i fa waxati nun duniɲa raɲɔnyi bara makɔrɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo mɛnni wo yɛtɛ ma, mixi yo naxa fa wo ratantan. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Mixi wuyaxi fama n xili falade e yɛtɛ xun ma a falafe ra, ‹N tan nan na Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra.› Na kui, e fama mixi gbegbe ratantande.»<verse eid="MAT 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />«Wo gere fe mɛma nɛ, wo gere ndee xili mɛ, kɔnɔ wo naxa kɔntɔfili, barima fo na fe mɔɔlie xa raba. Na xa mu findima duniɲa raɲɔnyi ra sinden. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Sie kelima nɛ e boore xili ma, ɲamanɛe e boore gere. Kaamɛ sinma nɛ bɔxi wuyaxi ma, bɔxi fan sɛrɛn yire gbegbe. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Na fe birin findima mantɔɔrɔlie fɔlɛ nan na.»<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />«Na tɛmui, mixie wo soma nɛ mangasanyi yi, e xa wo ɲaxankata, e wo faxa. Sie birin wo xɔnma nɛ n xili xa fe ra. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Danxaniyatɔɛ gbegbe birama nɛ tantanyi kui na waxati, e e booree yanfa xɔnnanteya kui. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Wule falɛ gbegbe fan e yɛtɛ findima nɛ namiɲɔnmɛe ra, e mixi gbegbe ratantan. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kobiɲa gboma nɛ han mixi gbegbe xa xanunteya xinbeli, <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />kɔnɔ naxan na a tunnabɛxi han a raɲɔnyi, na kanyi kisima nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ala xa mangɛya niini xibaaru fanyi kawandima nɛ duniɲa birin kui, a findi seedeɲɔxɔya ra sie birin bɛ. Na xanbi, duniɲa raɲɔnyi fama a lide.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Wo tan naxee na yi xaranfe, wo wo tuli mati de! Wo na se haramuxi ɲaaxi to kasarɛ na naxan xanbi ra, a tixi yire sɛniyɛnxi kui, Annabi Daniyɛli naxan ma fe fala, <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />wo tan naxee na Yudaya, wo lanma wo xa wo gi geyae fari. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Naxan na tande, a naxa so sese tongode a xa banxi kui. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Naxan na xɛ ma, a naxa gbilen a xa xinbeli donma tongode. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Na waxati findima gbaloe nan na furuginɛe nun dingɛe bɛ! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Wo Ala maxandi na naxa wo li ɲɛmɛ tɛmui, xa na mu a ra malabu lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Barima tɔɔrɛ a lima na waxati ma naxan maniyɛ singe mu nu to kabi duniɲa daa, a man mu gbilenma to ra abadan. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Xa Marigi mu a ragirixi nu nde xa ba na xi kɔnti ra, adama yo mu kisima nu. Kɔnɔ a nde bama a kɔnti ra mixi sugandixie nan ma fe ra.»<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />«Na waxati, xa mixi nde sa a fala wo bɛ, ‹A mato, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi na be›, xa na mu a ra, ‹Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi na mɛnni›, wo naxa la a ra. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Barima wule falɛe fama Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xili falade e yɛtɛ xun, xa na mu e e yɛtɛ findi namiɲɔnmɛe ra. E fama tɔnxuma makaabaxie nun kaabanakoe rabade alako e xa Ala xa mixi sugandixie ratantan, xa e sa nɔma. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Wo wo tuli ti, n bara a masen wo bɛ beenun a waxati xa a li.»<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />«Na kui, xa e sa a fala wo bɛ, ‹A mato, a sa na wula i›, wo naxa siga de! Xa e sa a fala wo bɛ, ‹A mato, a na banxi kui be›, wo naxa la a ra de! <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Adama xa Di na fa, a luma nɛ alɔ seyamakɔnyi naxan yanbama koore ma kelife sogetede han sogegorode. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />‹Binbi na lu dɛnnaxɛ, yubɛe sa e malanma mɛnni nɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa gbilenyi nun xɔrɛ bili xa misaali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-31">Maraki 13:24-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:25-33">Luki 21:25-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Na ɲaxankatɛ waxati dangi xanbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">‹soge ifɔɔrɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">kike yanbɛ bama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">tunbuie birama nɛ bɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">se naxan birin na koore ma e sɛrɛnma nɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />«Na tɛmui, Adama xa Di xa tɔnxuma minima nɛ koore ma. Duniɲa bɔnsɔɛ birin sunnunma nɛ. E Adama xa Di toma nɛ fa ra nuxui kui sɛnbɛ nun nɔrɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />A a xa malekɛe xɛɛma nɛ han duniɲa dande, e xa sa a xa mixi sugandixie malan sara xui ra keli duniɲa tunxun naani birin ma.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Wo xɔrɛ bili mato misaali ra, wo xa xaxili sɔtɔ. A salonyi na ɲingi, a burɛxɛ nɛɛnɛ mini, wo a kolonma ɲɛmɛ tɛmui bara makɔrɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Adama xa Di fafe fan na na ki nɛ. Wo na yi fe birin to, wo xa a kolon a a bara makɔrɛ, a ɲan tixi naadɛ ra. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, to mixie mu dangima fo na fe birin naba. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Koore nun bɔxi dangima nɛ, kɔnɔ n ma masenyi tan mu dangima abadan, a mu kanama muku.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duniɲa raɲɔnyi waxati kolonfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maraki 13:32-37</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luki 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">17:34-36</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Mixi yo mu a kolon yi fee sa rabama lɔxɔɛ nun waxati yo ma. Hali malekɛ naxee na ariyanna, e mu a kolon, Ala xa Di fan mu a kolon, fo Baba Ala keren peti. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Adama xa Di fa lɔxɔɛ luma nɛ alɔ Annabi Nuha xa waxati. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Beenun na banbaranyi belebele xa duniɲa li, mixie nu e dɛgema, e nu e minma, e nu ginɛe dɔxɔma, e nu e xa die fima xɛmɛe ma, han Annabi Nuha so kunkui kui lɔxɔ naxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />E mu nu kɔntɔfilixi fefe ra, han banbaranyi naxa e li, a e birin xanin. Adama xa Di fafe fan nabama na ki nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Xa xɛmɛ firin na xɛ ma na waxati, keren tongoma nɛ, boore lu naa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Xa ginɛ firin na se dinfe mulunyi keren kui, keren tongoma nɛ, boore lu naa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Na kui, wo naxa yanfa, barima wo mu wo Marigi fa lɔxɔɛ kolon. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Wo xa a fahaamu a fanyi ra, xa banxi kanyi a kolon nɛ nu muɲɛti fama tɛmui naxɛ kɔɛ kui, a mu xima nu, alako muɲɛti naxa nɔ sode a xɔnyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Na nan a ra, wo fan xa wo tagi ixiri, wo naxa yanfa, barima Adama xa Di fama waxati nan ma wo ɲɔxɔ mu naxan ma.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Nde luma alɔ konyi naxan findixi xaxilima dugutɛgɛ ra? A marigi bara a ti a xa banxi walikɛe birin xun ma, a xa donsee taxun e ra a waxati. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na na konyi bɛ, naxan marigi a lima na wali ra. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, na marigi a harige birin taxuma nɛ na konyi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 24:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />«Kɔnɔ xa na konyi findi a kobi ra, a a falama nɛ a yɛtɛ ma, ‹N marigi buma nɛ fafe ra,› <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />a fa a boore konyie bɔnbɔ fɔlɔ, a nu lu a dɛge ra, a a min, e nun siisilae. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Lɔxɔ nde fama, a tan konyi mu naxan kolon, a ɲɔxɔ man mu lɔxɔɛ naxan ma, a marigi gbilenma nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />A na fa, a na konyi ɲaxankatama nɛ a ɲaaxi ra, konyi gbaloe sɔtɔ e nun filankafuie, a woli wa nun ɲin maxinyi na dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛdimɛdi fu xa taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Na waxati, Ala xa mangɛya luma nɛ alɔ ginɛdimɛdi mixi fu, naxee e xa lanpuie tongo sigafe ra ginɛdɔxɔɛ ralande, e xa sa lan a xa futi xiri ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Na ginɛdimɛdie ya ma, suuli, xaxilitaree, suuli, xaxilimae. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Naxee findi xaxilitaree ra, e naxa e xa lanpuie xanin, kɔnɔ e mu ture xanin e xun naxan sama lanpuie kui. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Naxee tan findi xaxilimae ra, kankan naxa ture bitirɛ xanin a xun, a nun e xa lanpuie.»<verse eid="MAT 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />«Ginɛdɔxɔɛ to bu fafe ra, xi xɔli naxa ginɛdimɛdie suxu, e naxa xi. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Kɔɛ tagi, sɔnxɔɛ xui naxa mini, ‹Ginɛdɔxɔɛ bara fa! Wo sa a ralan!› <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Ginɛdimɛdie naxa keli, e e xa lanpuie yailan. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Xaxilitaree naxa a fala xaxilimae bɛ, ‹Wo muxu ki wo xa ture nde ra, barima muxu xa lanpuie na xubenfe.› <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Kɔnɔ xaxilimae naxa e yaabi, ‹Ade, a mu won birin nalima. Wo siga ture matie xɔn wo xa sa wo gbe sara.› <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Nee to siga ture sarade, ginɛdɔxɔɛ naxa fa. Ginɛdimɛdi naxee nu bara ture sa e xa lanpuie kui, nee tan naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra, e so futixiri xulunyi, naadɛ fa balan e xanbi ra.»<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />«Na dangi xanbi, ginɛdimɛdi xaxilitaree fan naxa fa, e a fala, ‹Marigi, marigi, naadɛ rabi muxu bɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Kɔnɔ a naxa e yaabi, ‹N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, n mu wo kolon.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />«Na kui, wo naxa yanfa, barima wo mu na lɔxɔɛ nun na waxati kolon.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Harige taxuxi xa taali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luki 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«A luma nɛ alɔ xɛmɛ nde naxan nu fafe biyaaside. A naxa a xa konyie xili, a a harige taxu e ra. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />A naxa xɛɛma kilo suuli so konyi keren yi, a firin so boore yi, a keren so a saxan nde yi ra. A to kankan bɛrɛ so a yi, a naxa biyaasi.»<verse eid="MAT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />«Xɛɛma kilo suuli taxu konyi naxan na, a naxa siga keren na, a xa sa na harige rawali. A naxa xɛɛma kilo suuli gbɛtɛ sɔtɔ geeni ra. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Xɛɛma kilo firin taxu konyi naxan na, a fan naxa na harige rawali, a xɛɛma kilo firin gbɛtɛ sɔtɔ geeni ra. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Kɔnɔ xɛɛma kilo keren taxu konyi naxan na, a tan naxa sa yili ge, a a marigi xa kɔbiri nɔxun na kui.»<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />«A to bu han, konyie marigi naxa gbilen e yire alako e xa dɛntɛgɛ sa a bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Xɛɛma kilo suuli taxu konyi naxan na, a naxa fa a marigi harige ra, a a fala, ‹N marigi, i xɛɛma kilo suuli nan taxu n na. A mato, n bara kilo suuli man sa a xun geeni ra.› <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />A marigi naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹I nuwali. Konyi dugutɛgɛ nan i ra, walikɛ fanyi. N to harige dondoronti taxu i ra, i mu lanlanteya kana, n fa harige gbegbe nan taxuma i ra. Fa n xɔnyi, wo nun i marigi xa lu sɛɛwɛ kui.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />«Na xanbi, xɛɛma kilo firin taxu konyi naxan na, a fan naxa fa, a a fala, ‹N marigi, i xɛɛma kilo firin nan taxu n na. A mato, n bara kilo firin man sa a xun geeni ra.› <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />A marigi naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹I nuwali. Konyi dugutɛgɛ nan i ra, walikɛ fanyi. N to harige dondoronti taxu i ra, i mu lanlanteya kana, n fa harige gbegbe nan taxuma i ra. Fa n xɔnyi, wo nun i marigi xa lu sɛɛwɛ kui.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />«A dɔnxɔɛ ra, xɛɛma kilo keren taxu konyi naxan na, a fan naxa fa, a a fala, ‹N marigi, n a kolon i xa fe maxɔrɔxɔ. I sansi xabama, i mu naxan garansan. I sansi bogi bama, i mu naxan si. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />N gaaxu nɛ. N naxa sa i xa xɛɛma kilo keren nɔxun yili kui. A mato, a tan nan yi ki. I harige sese mu lɔɛxi.› <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />A marigi naxa a yaabi, ‹I tan konyi kobi tunnaxɔnɛ! I nu a kolon a n sansi xabama, n mu naxan garansan, n man sansi bogi bama, n mu naxan si? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />A lan nɛ nu i n ma kɔbiri so kɔbiri rawalie yi ra, alako n na fa i yire tɛmui naxɛ, i n harige ragbilen n ma, geeni saxi a xun ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Na kui, wo xɛɛma kilo rasuxu a yi, wo a so konyi yi ra, xɛɛma kilo fu na naxan yi, <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />barima a na naxan yo yi ra, a gbe xun masama nɛ, a gbo ki fanyi. Kɔnɔ a mu na naxan yi ra, hali naxan di na a yi, na yati bama nɛ a yi ra. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Wo yi konyi fufafu woli tande dimi kui, wa nun ɲin maxinyi na dɛnnaxɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiiti dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Adama xa Di na fa a xa nɔrɛ kui, a nun a xa malekɛe, a a magoroma nɛ a xa kibanyi nɔrɔxi kui. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Si birin malanma nɛ a ya ra. A mixi mayegetima nɛ alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyi yɛxɛɛe nun sie mayegetima ki naxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />A yɛxɛɛe tima nɛ a yirefanyi ma, a sie fan ti a kɔɔla ma.»<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />«Na tɛmui, mangɛ a falama nɛ mixie bɛ naxee na a yirefanyi ma, ‹Wo fa, n Baba naxee barakaxi. Wo fa mangɛya sɔtɔ wo kɛ ra, mangɛya naxan yailanxi wo bɛ kabi duniɲa fɔlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Barima kaamɛ to nu n ma, wo naxa n ki donse. Ye xɔli to nu n ma, wo naxa n ki ye. Xɔɲɛ to nu n na, wo naxa n yigiya. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />N mageli to nu a ra, wo naxa dugie fi n ma. N to nu furaxi, wo naxa fa mɛɛni n ma. N to nu saxi geeli, wo naxa fa n yire matode.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />«Na tɛmui, tinxintɔɛe a maxɔrinma nɛ, ‹Marigi, muxu i to kaamɛ kui mun tɛmui, muxu fa i ki donse, xa na mu ye xɔli ra, muxu fa i ki ye? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Muxu i to xɔɲɛya ra mun tɛmui, muxu fa i yigiya, xa na mu i mageli ra, muxu fa dugie fi i ma? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Muxu i furaxi to mun tɛmui, xa na mu i saxi geeli, muxu fa siga i yire matode?› <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mangɛ e yaabima nɛ, ‹N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, wo naxan yo raba n ngaxakerenyi mixi xuri nde bɛ, wo a rabaxi n tan nan bɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />«Na xanbi, a a falama nɛ mixie bɛ naxee na a kɔɔla ma, ‹Wo wo makuya n na, wo tan mixi dankaxie, wo sa so tɛ xɔɔra naxan yailanxi Ibulisa nun a xa malekɛe bɛ, naxan mu xubenma abadan. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Barima kaamɛ to nu n ma, wo mu n ki donse. Ye xɔli to nu n ma, wo mu n ki ye. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Xɔɲɛ to nu n na, wo mu n yigiya. N mageli to nu a ra, wo mu dugie fi n ma. N furaxi to nu a ra, n man to nu saxi geeli, wo mu fa mɛɛnide n ma.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />«Na tɛmui, e fan a maxɔrinma nɛ, ‹Marigi, muxu i to mun tɛmui kaamɛ na i ma, xa na mu ye xɔli, xa na mu i findixi xɔɲɛ ra, xa na mu i mageli ra, xa na mu i furaxi, xa na mu i saxi geeli, muxu fa tondi i malide?› <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Mangɛ e yaabima nɛ, ‹N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, wo mu naxan yo raba n ngaxakerenyi mixi xuri nde bɛ, wo tondixi a rabade n tan nan bɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ɲaxankatɛ nan nagataxi na mixie bɛ abadan, kɔnɔ tinxintɔɛe tan abadan kisi nan sɔtɔma.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Yanfanteya Isa bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maraki 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luki 22:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yaya 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Isa to gɛ yi fe birin masende, a naxa a fala a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Wo a kolon, xi firin nan luxi Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali xa a li. Na tɛmui, Adama xa Di sama nɛ mixie bɛlɛxɛ e xa a banban wuri magalanbuxi ma.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Na waxati, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Yuwifie xa forie nu malanxi Kayafa xɔnyi, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie xunyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />E naxa lan a ma e xa Isa suxu yanfanteya saabui ra, e xa a faxa. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Kɔnɔ e naxa a fala, «Won naxa a suxu sali lɔxɔɛ, xa na mu a ra ɲama a xunyi ikelima nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ginɛ nde fe fanyi rabafe Isa bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maraki 14:3-9</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yaya 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Isa to nu na Betani, Simɔn kunɛ kanyi xɔnyi, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />ginɛ nde naxa fa a yire. Labundɛ ture nu na a yi ra, naxan sare xɔrɔxɔ ki fanyi. A nu saxi a bitirɛ tofanyi kui naxan nu rafalaxi alabatira gɛmɛ ra. Isa nu na teebili ra tɛmui naxɛ, ginɛ naxa fa, a na labundɛ ture ifili Isa xunyi ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe to na to, e naxa xɔnɔ, e a fala, «Yi birin makanaxi munfe ra? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Xa yi labundɛ ture sa mati nu, kɔbiri gbegbe nan sɔtɔma nu a xa fe ra, na fan nɔ fide setaree ma.»<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Isa to nu a kolon e naxan falafe e bore bɛ, a naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo na yi ginɛ tɔɔrɔfe munfe ra? Kɛwali fanyi nan yi ki, a naxan nabaxi n bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Setaree luma nɛ wo ya ma tɛmui birin, kɔnɔ n tan mu luma wo yi ra be abadan xɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Yi ginɛ to labundɛ ture saxi n fate ma, a a rabaxi n fure ragatafe nan xa fe ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, Ala xa xibaaru fanyi sa kawandima dɛdɛ duniɲa birin kui, yi ginɛ xa kɛwali xa fe fan falama nɛ, mixie xa e ratu a xa fe ma.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi xa yanfanteya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maraki 14:10-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luki 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Na tɛmui, Yudasi Isikariyoti, naxan nu na Isa fɔxirabirɛ fu nun firinyie ya ma, a naxa siga sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie xɔn ma, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />a e maxɔrin, «Wo munse soma n yi n xa Isa sa wo bɛlɛxɛ?» E fan naxa gbeti kole tongo saxan so a yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Keli na tɛmui ma, a naxa so waxati fenfe a nɔma Isa sode e yi ra tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maraki 14:12-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luki 22:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:-1-23">22-23</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yaya 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Taami Lɛbinitare Sali to a li, a lɔxɔɛ singe ma, Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa sa a maxɔrin, «I wama muxu xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali donyi rafala i bɛ minden?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />A naxa e yaabi, «Wo siga taa kui xɛmɛ nde xɔn, wo a fala a bɛ, ‹Karamɔxɔ naxɛ a a xa waxati bara makɔrɛ. A wama Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali rabafe i xɔnyi, a nun a fɔxirabirɛe.›» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa a raba alɔ Isa e yamari ki naxɛ, e Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali donyi rafala.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Nunmare to so, Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛ fu nun firinyie nu na teebili ra. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />E nu e dɛgefe tɛmui naxɛ, a naxa a masen, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, mixi keren na wo ya ma naxan fama n yanfade.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Na naxa e sunnun ki fanyi, kankan naxa a maxɔrin, «Kɔnɔ n Marigi, n tan mu a ra de, ka?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />A naxa e yaabi, «N nun naxan bara bɛlɛxɛ ragoro paani keren kui, na kanyi nan n yanfama. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Adama xa Di sigama nɛ alɔ a xa fe sɛbɛxi ki naxɛ, kɔnɔ gbaloe nan na Adama xa Di yanfama bɛ. A fisa na kanyi bɛ hali a mu bari nu.» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yudasi naxan nu fafe a yanfade, a naxa Isa maxɔrin, «Karamɔxɔ, n tan mu a ra de, ka?» Isa naxa a yaabi, «I tan nan a falaxi.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Marigi xa sɛrɛxɛ tɔnxuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maraki 14:22-26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luki 22:14-20</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">Korinti I 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />E to nu e dɛgefe, Isa naxa taami tongo. A to tantui rasiga Ala ma, a naxa taami igira, a a so a fɔxirabirɛe yi ra, a a masen e bɛ, a naxɛ, «Wo n ko, wo a don. Yi findixi n fate nan na.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Na dangi xanbi, Isa naxa tɔnbili fan tongo. A man to tantui rasiga Ala ma, a naxa tɔnbili so e yi ra, a a fala e bɛ, «Wo birin xa a min. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Yi findixi n wuli nan na, saatɛ wuli naxan baxi mixi gbegbe bɛ e xa yunubie xafarife ra. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />N xa a fala wo bɛ, n to yi wɛni minma, n mu yi minma sɔnɔn, han won birin man sa a minma lɔxɔ naxɛ n Baba xɔnyi ariyanna.»<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />E to gɛ bɛɛti bade, e naxa te Oliwi geya fari.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a falafe Piyɛri bɛ a a yɛtɛ rasanma nɛ a ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maraki 14:27-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luki 22:31-34</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yaya 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Na tɛmui Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo birin gbilenma nɛ n fɔxɔ ra to kɔɛ ra, wo mɛɛ n ma fe ra, barima a sɛbɛxi, ‹N xuruse dɛmadonyi faxama nɛ, yɛxɛɛe fan yensen.› <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Kɔnɔ n na keli faxɛ ma, n sigama wo ya ra Galile.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «Hali birin gbilen i fɔxɔ ra, n tan mu gbilenma i fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Isa naxa Piyɛri yaabi, «N xa nɔndi fala i bɛ, to kɔɛ yati, beenun konkore xa a rate, i i yɛtɛ rasanma nɛ n ma sanmaya saxan.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Piyɛri man naxa a yaabi, «Hali won birin nan sa faxama, n mu n yɛtɛ rasanma i ma!» Isa fɔxirabirɛ birin naxa na wɔyɛn keren fala.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Ala maxandife Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maraki 14:32-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luki 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Na dangi xanbi Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe naxa siga yire nde, dɛnnaxɛ xili Getesemani. Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo dɔxɔ be. N tan xa siga mɛnni Ala maxandide.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />A naxa Piyɛri nun Sebede xa di firinyie xanin a xun ma. Sunnunyi nun kɔntɔfili to Isa bɔɲɛ suxu, <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />a naxa a masen e bɛ, «Sunnunyi bara nɔ n bɔɲɛ ra alɔ a xa n faxa. Wo lu be, kɔnɔ wo naxa xi.»<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Isa naxa a masiga dondoronti, a a yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, a Ala maxandi, «N Baba, xa a sa nɔma rabade, i xa n natanga yi ɲaxankatɛ ma. Kɔnɔ n sago naxa raba, i tan nan sago xa raba.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />A to gbilen a fɔxirabirɛe yire, a naxa e li e na xife. A naxa a fala Piyɛri bɛ, «I mu nɔxi waxati keren xi xɔli kanade n ma fe ra? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Wo naxa xi. Wo Ala maxandi nɛ alako wo naxa bira tantanyi kui. Maɲɔxun fanyi na adama bɛ, kɔnɔ a fate bɛndɛ tan sɛnbɛ mu na.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Isa man to a masiga e ra, a naxa gbilen Ala maxandi ra, «N Baba, xa yi ɲaxankatɛ mu nɔma bade n yi ra, fo n xa tin a ra, i sago nan xa raba.» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />A to gbilen a fɔxirabirɛe yire, a man naxa e li e xife, barima xi xɔli nu bara nɔ e ra. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />A naxa e lu naa, a siga sanmaya saxan nde, a sa Ala maxandi na maxandi kerenyi ra. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Na tɛmui, a naxa gbilen a fɔxirabirɛe yire, a a masen e bɛ, «Wo xife nɛ? Wo na wo malabufe han ya? Wo a mato, waxati bara a li. Adama xa Di fafe sade yunubitɔɛe bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Wo keli, won xɛɛ. Wo a mato, n yanfama bara fa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa suxufe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maraki 14:43-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luki 22:47-53</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yaya 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Isa ɲan mu nu gɛxi wɔyɛnde, Yudasi, naxan nu na a fɔxirabirɛ fu nun firinyie ya ma, a naxa fa e nun ɲama gbegbe, santidɛgɛmae nun gbengbetae suxuxi e yi ra. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Yuwifie xa forie nan nu e xɛɛxi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Isa yanfama nun na ɲama nu bara lan a ma, a a xa Isa matɔnxuma e bɛ. A nu bara a fala e bɛ, «N na mixi naxan sunbu, a tan nan na ki. Wo na suxu.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Na kui, Yudasi naxa a maso Isa ra keren na, a a fala, «Karamɔxɔ, i nuwali,» a fa a sunbu. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Isa naxa a masen a bɛ, «N boore, i faxi naxan nabade, a raba.» Na tɛmui, na mixie naxa e maso Isa ra, e a suxu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ nde naxa a xa santidɛgɛma ramini, a sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xa konyi tuli bolon. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Santidɛgɛma raso a tɛɛ i. Naxan yo na findi a xa geresose ra, na kanyi fan faxama santidɛgɛma nan saabui ra. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ka i ɲɔxɔ a ma a n mu nɔma n Baba xilide, a malekɛe rasanba n ma keren na, naxee dangi malekɛ gali fu nun firin na? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Kɔnɔ xa na raba, Kitaabuie xa masenyie fa kamalima di? Barima e a masenxi nɛ a fo a xa raba yi ki nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Na xanbi, Isa naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo to minixi n xili ma santidɛgɛma nun gbengbeta suxuxi wo yi ra, suute nan na n na? Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, n dɔxɔxi hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, n kawandi tima, wo mu n suxu. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Kɔnɔ yi birin nabaxi nɛ alako namiɲɔnmɛe naxan sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, a xa kamali.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Na xanbi, Isa fɔxirabirɛe birin naxa e gi a xun ma.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa tife Yuwifi kuntigie ya i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maraki 14:53-65</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luki 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:12-24">Yaya 18:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Mixi naxee Isa suxu, e naxa a xanin sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Kayafa xɔnyi, sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun forie nu malanxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Piyɛri fan, a nu biraxi Isa fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ a ndedi nu makuyaxi ɲama ra. A naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra han a so sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie xunyi xa tɛtɛ kui. A naxa dɔxɔ hɔrɔmɔbanxi kantamae fɛ ma, alako a xa a mato Isa xa fe dangima ki naxɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Yuwifie xa kiitisa dɔnxɔɛ birin, e nu wule seede nde nan fenfe naxan bama Isa xili ma, e sa nɔma a faxade naxan ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Kɔnɔ e mu se to, hali tɔɔɲɛgɛti gbegbe to fa. A dɔnxɔɛ ra, xɛmɛ firin naxa fa, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />e a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ a fala nɛ, ‹N tan nɔma Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kanade, n man fa a ti xi saxan bun ma.›» <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xunyi naxa keli, a Isa maxɔrin, «Pe, i mu e yaabima? Yi xɛmɛe munse safe i xun ma yi ki?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Kɔnɔ Isa mu sese fala. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie xunyi naxa a fala a bɛ, «N bara i yamari i xa i kali Ala Ɲiɲɛ ra, i a fala muxu bɛ xa i findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan na, Ala xa Di.» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «I tan nan a falaxi. N man xa a fala wo bɛ, keli yi waxati ma, wo fama Adama xa Di tode, a dɔxɔxi Ala Sɛnbɛma yirefanyi ma, wo a toma fa ra nuxuie kui.»<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Na kui, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi naxa a yɛtɛ xa donma suxu, a ibɔɔ xɔnɛ ra, a a fala, «A bara Ala rasɔtɔ! Won hayi na seede gbɛtɛe ma yire? Wo bara a mɛ a Ala rasɔtɔxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Wo kiiti toxi di?» E naxa a yaabi, «A lanma a xa faxa nɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Na tɛmui, e naxa dɛye bɔxun Isa yatagi, e kamui sin a ma. Ndee naxa a dɛ ragarin, e nu a fala, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />«I tan, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi, namiɲɔnmɛɲa raba! A fala ba, naxan i bɔnbɔxi!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri a yɛtɛ rasanfe Isa ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maraki 14:66-72</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luki 22:56-62</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yaya 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Piyɛri nu dɔxɔxi tande, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xa tɛtɛ kui. Konyi ginɛ nde naxa a makɔrɛ a ra, a a fala, «I tan, wo nun Isa Galileka birin nan nu a ra.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Kɔnɔ Piyɛri naxa a matandi birin ya xɔri, a a fala, «N mu a kolon i na fefe falafe!» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Piyɛri to mini fɔlɔ tɛtɛ naadɛ ra, konyi ginɛ gbɛtɛ nde naxa a to, a a fala mixie bɛ naxee nu na naa, «Yi xɛmɛ naxan yi ki, e nun Isa Nasarɛtika nan nu a ra.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Piyɛri man naxa a matandi, a a kali, «N mu na xɛmɛ kolon!» <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />A mu bu, naxee nu tixi naa, e naxa e maso Piyɛri ra, e a fala a bɛ, «Nɔndi nan a ra, a tan mixi nde nan yati i ra, barima i wɔyɛnma alɔ Galileka.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Piyɛri naxa so a kalife, a a fala «Ala xa n danka! N tan mu na xɛmɛ kolon feo!» Na fala xanbi, konkore naxa a rate. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Piyɛri naxa ratu fa Isa xa wɔyɛnyi ma, «Beemanun konkore xa a rate, i i yɛtɛ rasanma nɛ n ma sanmaya saxan.» Na kui, a naxa mini, a sa wa han.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yuwifie Isa xaninfe Pilati xɔn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maraki 15:1</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">Luki 22:63-71</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yaya 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Kuye to iba, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie birin nun Yuwifie xa forie to nu malanxi, e naxa natɛ tongo e xa Isa faxa. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />E to Isa xiri, e naxa a xanin gomina Pilati xɔn.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yudasi, Isa yanfama, a to a to e bara Isa makiiti a lan a xa faxa, a naxa nimisa a xa yanfanteya xa fe ra. A naxa na gbeti kole tongo saxan nagbilen sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun forie ma, <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />a a fala, «N bara yunubi raba! Xɛmɛ naxan faxama yi ki, sɛniyɛntɔɛ nan a ra, a fa li n tan nan a yanfaxi!» E naxa a yaabi, «Na mu muxu tan matoxi. Na i tan nan matoxi.» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />A to gbeti kolee woli hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, Yudasi naxa siga a yɛtɛ gbakude wuri kɔn na. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie to gbeti kolee matongo, e naxa a fala, «A mu daxa muxu xa yi gbeti kolee sa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa kɔbiri xun ma, barima nii sare nan a ra.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />E to wɔyɛn, e naxa fɛɲɛ yailanyi xa xɛ yire sara na kɔbiri ra, na xa findi gaburi yire ra xɔɲɛe bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Na nan a toxi, han to na xɛ xili falama «Wuli Bɔxi.» <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Na kui, Annabi Yeremi xa masenyi naxa kamali, a to a masen, «E naxa gbeti kole tongo saxan tongo, Isirayilakae ndee sare naxan saxi a xun, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />e fɛɲɛ yailanyi xa xɛ sara na kɔbiri ra, alɔ Marigi n yamari ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa tife Pilati ya i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-15">Maraki 15:2-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:2-5">Luki 23:2-5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">13-25</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:28-19:16">Yaya 18:28-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Isa to ti gomina Pilati ya i, gomina naxa a maxɔrin, «I tan nan findixi Yuwifie xa mangɛ ra?» Isa naxa a yaabi, «I tan nan a falaxi.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Kɔnɔ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun forie nu a tɔɔɲɛgɛma tɛmui naxɛ, Isa mu yaabi yo fi. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Na tɛmui Pilati naxa a maxɔrin, «I mu yi fee mɛxi e naxan birin safe i xun ma yi ki?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Kɔnɔ Isa mu e xa wɔyɛnyi yo yaabi. Na naxa gomina kaaba ki fanyi.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Ɲɛ yo ɲɛ, sali tɛmui, gomina darife nan nu a ra, a xa geelimani keren nabɛɲin ɲama bɛ, e na wa naxan yo xɔn. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Na waxati, geelimani nde nu na, birin nu naxan kolon a xa ɲaaxuɲa ma. A nu xili Barabasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ɲama to malan, Pilati naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo wama n xa nde rabɛɲin wo bɛ, Barabasi ba, ka Isa, naxan xili falama Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilati nu a kolon a sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nu Isa saxi a bɛlɛxɛ tɔɔnɛ nan ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ba na ra, a to nu dɔxɔxi kiiti sade, a xa ginɛ naxa xɛɛra rasiga a ma, a a fala a bɛ, «I naxa so yi tinxintɔɛ xa fe kui fefe ma, barima n bara xiye sa a xa fe ra, xiye naxan bara n tɔɔrɔ to ki fanyi.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Kɔnɔ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Yuwifie xa forie naxa ɲama kui iso e xa Barabasi maxɔrin Pilati ma, Isa tan xa faxa. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Gomina man naxa e maxɔrin, «Yi mixi firin ya ma, wo wama n xa mundun nabɛɲin wo bɛ?» E naxa a yaabi, «Barabasi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilati fan naxa e maxɔrin, «N xa munse raba Isa ra, naxan xili falama Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi?» Ɲama birin naxa a yaabi, «A banban wuri magalanbuxi ma!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />A man naxa e maxɔrin, «Munfe ma? A fe ɲaaxi mundun nabaxi?» Kɔnɔ e tan sɔnxɔɛ nan tun xun masa, «A banban wuri ma!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilati to a to a a mu nɔxi fefe ra, ɲama fan nu waxi kelife a ra, a naxa ye tongo, a a bɛlɛxɛ raxa e ya xɔri, a a fala e bɛ, «Yi xɛmɛ faxafe mu na n tan ma de! A luma wo tan nan ma.» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Ɲama birin naxa a yaabi, «A xa faxɛ wuli xa lu muxu nun muxu xa die xun ma!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Na kui, Pilati naxa Barabasi rabɛɲin e bɛ. A naxa yaamari fi sɔɔrie xa Isa bɔnbɔ sɛbɛrɛ ra. Na xanbi, a naxa Isa so e yi e xa sa a banban wuri magalanbuxi ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔɔrie Isa mayelefe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maraki 15:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yaya 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Rɔma sɔɔrie to Isa xanin gomina xɔnyi, e naxa e boore sɔɔrie birin xili, e gali naxa ti a rabilinyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />E naxa Isa xa sose ba a ma, e mangɛ guba gbeeli ragoro a ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />E naxa tunbee mafilin, e e yailan mangɛ katanyi maniyɛ ra, e a sa a xun ma. E naxa wuri raso a yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ kui, e a mayele, e nu e xinbi sin a bun ma, e nu a fala, «I kɛna, Yuwifie xa mangɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />E naxa dɛye bɔxun a ma, e na wuri ba a yi, e nu a xunyi bɔnbɔ a ra. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />E to gɛ Isa mayelede, e naxa mangɛ guba rate a ma, e a gbe dugi ragoro a ma, e fa a ramini e xa sa a banban wuri magalanbuxi ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa banbanfe wuri magalanbuxi ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maraki 15:21-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luki 23:26-43</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yaya 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />E to nu minife taa ra, e naxa Sirenika xɛmɛ nde to naxan nu xili Simɔn. Sɔɔrie naxa a yamari, a tan xa Isa xa wuri magalanbuxi xanin. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />E to yire li naxan xili Gologota, na nan falaxi e xa xui, «xunkonkota yire,» <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />e naxa wɛni so a yi, seri saxi naxan xun, kɔnɔ a to a nɛmunnɛmun, a mu tin a minde.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />E to gɛ a mabanbande wuri ma, e naxa kanda bun a xa dugie xa fe ra, alako e xa a kolon kankan naxan sɔtɔma. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Na dangi xanbi, e naxa dɔxɔ a kantade.<verse eid="MAT 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />E to nu wama birin xa a kolon e a banbanxi fe naxan ma, e yi sɛbɛli nan gbaku a xun ma, «Isa nan ya, Yuwifie xa mangɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Na tɛmui, e naxa suute mixi firin fan banban wuri magalanbuxie ma Isa fɛ ma, keren a yirefanyi ma, boore a kɔɔla ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Mixie nu dangima Isa konbi ra, e nu e xunyi lintan a ma, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />e a fala, «I tan naxan hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabirama, i man fa a ti xi saxan bun ma, i yɛtɛ rakisi! Xa Ala xa Di nan i ra, goro wuri kɔn na!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie, sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe, nun Yuwifie xa forie fan nu a mayelefe, e nu a fala, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«A bara mixi gbɛtɛe rakisi, kɔnɔ a mu nɔma a yɛtɛ tan nakiside. Isirayila mangɛ xa mu a ra? A xa goro wuri kɔn na be ya, alako muxu xa la a ra. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />A bara a xaxili ti Ala ra, a man fa a fala, ‹N findixi Ala xa Di nan na.› Yakɔsi, xa a rafanxi Ala ma, a xa a rakisi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Suute naxee nu banbanxi a fɛ ma, e fan nu Isa konbife na ki nɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maraki 15:33-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luki 23:44-49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yaya 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Yanyi tagi, dimi naxa sin bɔxi birin ma lɛɛri saxan bun ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Na waxati ma, Isa naxa gbelegbele sɛnbɛ ra, «Eloyi, Eloyi, lɛma sabaxatani?» Na nan falaxi e xa xui, «N Marigi Ala, n Marigi Ala, i n nabɛɲinxi munfe ra?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Mixi naxee nu na naa, e to a xui mɛ, e naxa a fala, «A na Annabi Eliya nan xilife!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Mixi nde naxa a gi, a sa dunkobi rasin wɛni xɔnɛ xɔɔra, a a so wuri dɛ i, a fa a ti Isa bɛ alako a xa a min. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Kɔnɔ booree naxa a fala, «Wo a lu, won xa a mato xa Annabi Eliya fama a rakiside.» <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Isa man naxa a xui ite sɛnbɛ ra, a fa laaxira.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Na waxati, dugi xungbe naxan singanxi hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a naxa ibɔɔ firin na, keli a fuge han a laabe. Bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn, gɛmɛe naxa ibɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />gaburie fan naxa rabi. Sɛniyɛntɔɛ laaxiraxi gbegbe naxa keli faxɛ ma, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />e mini gaburie kui. Isa to keli faxɛ ma, e so nɛ Darisalamu, taa sɛniyɛnxi kui, e fa mini mixi wuyaxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Sɔɔri mangɛ nun a boore sɔɔrie naxee nu Isa kantafe, e to bɔxi xa sɛrɛnyi to, a nun naxan naba Isa faxa tɛmui, e naxa gaaxu ki fanyi, e a fala, «Nɔndi nan a ra yati, Ala xa Di nan nu yi xɛmɛ ra!»<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Ginɛ wuyaxi fan nu na naa, e ndedi makuyaxi Isa yire ra, e yi fe birin matoma. E nu bara bira Isa fɔxɔ ra kelife Galile bɔxi ma, e nu a mali. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mariyama Magidalaka nu na e ya ma, a nun Mariyama Yaki nun Yusufu nga, a nun Sebede xa die nga.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa maragatɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maraki 15:42-47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luki 23:50-56</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yaya 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Nunmare to so, Arimateka bannamixi nde naxa fa naxan nu xili Yusufu. Isa fɔxirabirɛ nde nan nu a fan na. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />A naxa siga Pilati yire, a Isa fure maxandi a ma. Pilati naxa yaamari fi e xa a so a yi ra. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu naxa Isa fure tongo, a a mafilin kasange fanyi kui, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />a a bɛlɛ gaburi nɛɛnɛ kui, naxan nu gexi gɛmɛ kui a tan Yusufu bɛ. A to gɛmɛ xungbe maɲindigilin, a a dɔxɔ gaburi dɛ ma, a naxa siga. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariyama Magidalaka nun boore Mariyama nu na naa, e dɔxɔxi gaburi ya ra.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔɔrie tife Isa xa gaburi kantade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Malabu lɔxɔɛ see rafala lɔxɔɛ kuye iba, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Farisɛnie naxa siga Pilati yire. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />E naxa a masen a bɛ, «Mangɛ, muxu ratuxi a ma yi wule falɛ, beenun a xa faxa, a a fala nɛ, ‹Xi saxan dangi xanbi, n kelima nɛ faxɛ ma.› <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Na kui, i xa yaamari fi a xa gaburi xa makanta han a xi saxan nde, alako a fɔxirabirɛe naxa fa a fure muɲa, e fa a fala ɲama bɛ, ‹A bara keli faxɛ ma.› Xa na sa raba, wule dɔnxɔɛ dangima nɛ wule singe ra.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilati naxa e yaabi, «Awa, n bara sɔɔrie so wo yi. Wo sa gaburi makanta alɔ wo wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />E naxa siga, e sa tɔnxuma sa gɛmɛ ma naxan nu na gaburi dɛ ma, alako xa gaburi fa sa rabi, a kolonma nɛ. E naxa sɔɔrie lu naa, na kantafe ra.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Isa xa marakeli faxɛ ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maraki 16:1-10</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luki 24:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yaya 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Malabu lɔxɔɛ kuye iba, sande lɔxɔɛ subaxɛ ma, Mariyama Magidalaka nun boore Mariyama, e naxa siga gaburi matode. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Na tɛmui, bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn sɛnbɛ ra, barima Marigi xa malekɛ nde nu bara goro keli koore, a gɛmɛ maɲindigilin, a a ba gaburi dɛ ma, a fa dɔxɔ a fari. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Malekɛ nu yanbama alɔ seyamakɔnyi, a xa sosee nu fiixɛ fɔɛn. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Sɔɔri naxee nu na kantafe, e naxa gaaxu han e sɛrɛn, e lu alɔ faxamixie. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Kɔnɔ malekɛ naxa a masen ginɛe bɛ, «Wo naxa gaaxu, barima n a kolon wo na Isa nan fenfe, e naxan banban wuri magalanbuxi ma. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />A mu be, a bara keli faxɛ ma, alɔ a a fala ki naxɛ. Wo fa, wo a mato a nu saxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Wo man xa siga mafuren, wo sa a masen a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, ‹A bara keli faxɛ ma. A na sigafe wo ya ra Galile. Wo a toma mɛnni nɛ.› A tan nan na ki, n bara a ragbilen wo ma.»<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ginɛe naxa e xulun, e keli gaburi yire, gaaxui nun sɛɛwɛ gbegbe ra, e siga e gi ra na xibaaru masende Isa fɔxirabirɛe bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa e ralan, a e xɛɛbu, «Wo mama.» E to e maso a ra, e naxa suyidi a bɛ, e a sanyie suxu. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo naxa gaaxu. Wo sa a fala n ngaxakerenyie bɛ e xa siga Galile. E n toma mɛnni nɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔɔrie nun Yuwifi kuntigie wule xabufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ginɛe nu sigafe tɛmui naxɛ, sɔɔri nde naxee nu gaburi kantafe, e naxa so taa kui. Fe naxan birin naba, e naxa sa a dɛntɛgɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Nee nun forie fan to e malan yire keren, e naxa natɛ tongo, e kɔbiri gbegbe fi sɔɔrie ma <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />yi yaamari ra, «Wo xa yi nan fala, ‹Isa fɔxirabirɛe nan fa kɔɛ ra, e a fure muɲa muxu nu na xife tɛmui naxɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Xa a sa li gomina naxa yi fe mɛ, muxu sa wɔyɛnma a bɛ alako sese naxa wo to.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Na kui, sɔɔrie naxa kɔbiri rasuxu, e fe birin naba alɔ a falaxi e bɛ ki naxɛ. Na masenyi naxa yensen yɛ Yuwifie tagi. Han to na fe mɛma.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xɛɛraya fife a fɔxirabirɛe ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maraki 16:14-18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luki 24:36-49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yaya 20:19-23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Taruxui 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ fu nun kerenyie naxa siga Galile bɔxi ma, e te geya fari Isa dɛnnaxan masen e bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />E to a to, e naxa suyidi a bɛ, kɔnɔ e man nu siikɛxi. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Isa naxa a maso e ra, a a masen e bɛ, «Sɛnbɛ birin bara so n yi ra koore nun duniɲa ma. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Na kui, wo xa siga, wo sa si birin findi n fɔxirabirɛe ra. Wo xa e xunxa ye xɔɔra Baba Ala, a xa Di, nun a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xili ra. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Wo xa e tinkan n ma yaamari birin nabatude. Wo a mato, n na wo fɛ ma tɛmui birin, han duniɲa raɲɔnyi.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>